(819118, 92668, 327, '<td valign="top">I''d of liked some chocolate on her face or hands and a tighter crop to draw us into the moment. She has beautiful brown eyes and is cute as a button. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''d of liked some chocolate on her face or hands and a tighter crop to draw us into the moment. She has beautiful brown eyes and is cute as a button. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2004-07-21 01:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
