(819131, 92163, 327, '<td valign="top">She doesn''t look too happy. Needs another cookie. Maybe a bit more focus to help sharpen this up. Your colors are very good.</td>', 'She doesn''t look too happy. Needs another cookie. Maybe a bit more focus to help sharpen this up. Your colors are very good.', '2004-07-21 01:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(819132, 92678, 23100, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the swirls. Maybe sharper focus to include the leaf?</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the swirls. Maybe sharper focus to include the leaf?', '2004-07-21 01:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(819133, 92567, 22385, '<td valign="top">This photo really bothers me... I almost want to eat this frog.  Must resist the thought!  Very disturbing!  I like the creativity of this photo.  While this is not a ribbon winner in my opinion, this concept could be re-worked in a more "stylish" photo.  (sorry that probably sounds vague)</td>', 'This photo really bothers me... I almost want to eat this frog.  Must resist the thought!  Very disturbing!  I like the creativity of this photo.  While this is not a ribbon winner in my opinion, this concept could be re-worked in a more "stylish" photo.  (sorry that probably sounds vague)', '2004-07-21 01:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(819134, 92616, 7252, '<td valign="top">Good photo but there are quite a few distractions. I think first a more overhead approach would have been better so that you don''t see the end of the table and the wall in the background. Ironing the tablecloth and avoiding stains would also help for a more polished appearance. If you put the darkest chocolate closes to the light it would avoid being lost in the shadow of the cake.</td>', 'Good photo but there are quite a few distractions. I think first a more overhead approach would have been better so that you don''t see the end of the table and the wall in the background. Ironing the tablecloth and avoiding stains would also help for a more polished appearance. If you put the darkest chocolate closes to the light it would avoid being lost in the shadow of the cake.', '2004-07-21 01:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(819136, 92517, 23100, '<td valign="top">Great concept and composition. The ice begs for sharper focus though.</td>', 'Great concept and composition. The ice begs for sharper focus though.', '2004-07-21 01:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(819138, 92326, 12583, '<td valign="top">This is very blah to me... I think Color would have worked much better here.</td>', 'This is very blah to me... I think Color would have worked much better here.', '2004-07-21 01:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(819139, 91633, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very strong visual. The lips and the heart express deisre and love for the chocolate. Great.</td>', 'A very strong visual. The lips and the heart express deisre and love for the chocolate. Great.', '2004-07-21 01:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(819141, 92578, 22307, '<td valign="top">sexy</td>', 'sexy', '2004-07-21 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(819142, 92519, 7252, '<td valign="top">Simple but I like the abstractness of it. Melting seems to have been a good choice. Takes away that chalky look chocolate chips have right out of the bag.</td>', 'Simple but I like the abstractness of it. Melting seems to have been a good choice. Takes away that chalky look chocolate chips have right out of the bag.', '2004-07-21 01:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
