(819156, 92243, 22385, '<td valign="top">This photo is so sad!  Yet very creative.  Way to go for thinking outside the box.  Great composition, and I like the focus on this.  Good luck!!</td>', 'This photo is so sad!  Yet very creative.  Way to go for thinking outside the box.  Great composition, and I like the focus on this.  Good luck!!', '2004-07-21 01:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
