(819952, 92645, 22922, '<td valign="top">The highlights here are very blown out, and make it hard to see the image.  Perhaps if you lowered your exposure time or used a different aperture?  Also, the two colors of chocolate make it look less like it''s melting and more like there''s chocolate syrup on top.  Try a hairdryer to melt the edges more convincingly, or melt the same type of chocolate and pour that down first.</td>', 'The highlights here are very blown out, and make it hard to see the image.  Perhaps if you lowered your exposure time or used a different aperture?  Also, the two colors of chocolate make it look less like it''s melting and more like there''s chocolate syrup on top.  Try a hairdryer to melt the edges more convincingly, or melt the same type of chocolate and pour that down first.', '2004-07-21 10:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
