(820077, 92561, 22922, '<td valign="top">While I appreciate the message, the image is so busy that I can''t really focus on anything.  There is a blown out highlight in the center that detracts from the dark image, and too many lines and colors war together for attention.</td>', 'While I appreciate the message, the image is so busy that I can''t really focus on anything.  There is a blown out highlight in the center that detracts from the dark image, and too many lines and colors war together for attention.', '2004-07-21 11:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(820079, 92561, 24452, '<td valign="top">Awesome! - This rocks, possibly the best photo ever. A photo of epic preportions, showing the imperfect equilibrium between the insatiable tenasity of western society and the contrasting poverty of the tertiary world. Perfect!</td>', 'Awesome! - This rocks, possibly the best photo ever. A photo of epic preportions, showing the imperfect equilibrium between the insatiable tenasity of western society and the contrasting poverty of the tertiary world. Perfect!', '2004-07-21 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
