(820098, 92670, 14614, '<td valign="top">very cleve :)<br/>I like the soft focus on the plate, cherry and syrup, would like the "YES" crisper. the grain works well as does the tiny dot.  the white lines on the syrup are a bit distracting (small nit)</td>', 'very cleve :)I like the soft focus on the plate, cherry and syrup, would like the "YES" crisper. the grain works well as does the tiny dot.  the white lines on the syrup are a bit distracting (small nit)', '2004-07-21 12:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(820100, 92416, 19425, '<td valign="top">Good pic. The only thing i can say is that i would have liked to seen the main piece of chocolate alittle sharper. It seems slightly soft or blurred.</td>', 'Good pic. The only thing i can say is that i would have liked to seen the main piece of chocolate alittle sharper. It seems slightly soft or blurred.', '2004-07-21 12:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(820102, 91794, 14614, '<td valign="top">yummm.  I like your choice of background colors -- adds a snap of color, well composed (not sure if I like the package as my eye gets drawn away to another element - would be different if this was the "advertising" challenge)</td>', 'yummm.  I like your choice of background colors -- adds a snap of color, well composed (not sure if I like the package as my eye gets drawn away to another element - would be different if this was the "advertising" challenge)', '2004-07-21 12:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(820105, 92382, 19425, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen it in color. It really doesnt portray chocolate to me. Im not saying it doesnt meet the challenge. Just saying that the chocolate egg just doesnt look like chocolate in the b/w toned colors.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen it in color. It really doesnt portray chocolate to me. Im not saying it doesnt meet the challenge. Just saying that the chocolate egg just doesnt look like chocolate in the b/w toned colors.', '2004-07-21 12:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
