(820116, 92450, 18854, '<td valign="top">Very good catch - I really like this one and hope it ribbons!</td>', 'Very good catch - I really like this one and hope it ribbons!', '2004-07-21 12:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(820117, 92400, 18854, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective.  Good off-center placement and the leaves add some contrasting color. I hope this ribbons!</td>', 'Very unique perspective.  Good off-center placement and the leaves add some contrasting color. I hope this ribbons!', '2004-07-21 12:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(820118, 92504, 18854, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition - a 10!</td>', 'Very cool composition - a 10!', '2004-07-21 12:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(820120, 91771, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the gradient color in the background - it compliments the colors and shades of the strawberry. It''s a good close up, well positioned in the frame. The touch of green breaks up the red nicely. The drip is good too, it gives it a sense of anticipation. The only nitpick is the focus - when I view it as a whole and quickly then it seems fine, but if I look at it longer then I notice the chocolate drip is out of focus and so are the green leaves. Overall I like it, probably the better of the dipped strawberry shots.</td>', 'I like the gradient color in the background - it compliments the colors and shades of the strawberry. It''s a good close up, well positioned in the frame. The touch of green breaks up the red nicely. The drip is good too, it gives it a sense of anticipation. The only nitpick is the focus - when I view it as a whole and quickly then it seems fine, but if I look at it longer then I notice the chocolate drip is out of focus and so are the green leaves. Overall I like it, probably the better of the dipped strawberry shots.', '2004-07-21 12:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(820122, 92407, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is always someone who has to think outside the box and be different! I like this, the composition is good, the background works, the focus is good, and you can clearly see what the item is. I havent tried the chocolate ones, so you''ll have to let us know after the challenge how it tasted.</td>', 'There is always someone who has to think outside the box and be different! I like this, the composition is good, the background works, the focus is good, and you can clearly see what the item is. I havent tried the chocolate ones, so you''ll have to let us know after the challenge how it tasted.', '2004-07-21 12:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(820123, 92542, 19425, '<td valign="top">i loved the photo, but i can''t see anything truly in focus. Nothing seems sharp. Maybe its my eyes, i dont know...either way...8</td>', 'i loved the photo, but i can''t see anything truly in focus. Nothing seems sharp. Maybe its my eyes, i dont know...either way...8', '2004-07-21 12:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(820124, 91240, 19425, '<td valign="top">White balance seems alittle off. Everything has a slight blue cast.</td>', 'White balance seems alittle off. Everything has a slight blue cast.', '2004-07-21 12:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(820125, 92568, 6008, '<td valign="top">Cute, my only reference to this is from the movie Benny and Joon but it made me smile to remember the scene. Without that reference I''m not sure how well it works as a photograph. The composition is fine, lighting is ok although the shadows are a little distracting, but without the context I''m sure it looks a little odd. I like it purely based on what I believe it represents. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Cute, my only reference to this is from the movie Benny and Joon but it made me smile to remember the scene. Without that reference I''m not sure how well it works as a photograph. The composition is fine, lighting is ok although the shadows are a little distracting, but without the context I''m sure it looks a little odd. I like it purely based on what I believe it represents. Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-07-21 12:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(820126, 92663, 19425, '<td valign="top">i have no idea what im looking at, and even if i really really looked, i dont see chocolate anywhere. sorry.</td>', 'i have no idea what im looking at, and even if i really really looked, i dont see chocolate anywhere. sorry.', '2004-07-21 12:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(820127, 92450, 19425, '<td valign="top">truly and amazing shot! 10</td>', 'truly and amazing shot! 10', '2004-07-21 12:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
