(820168, 92089, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure of the significance of the mixed background but it doesnt really look out of place, just different. The lighting isnt bad, the composition is fine, the focus is ok but the left hand side looks like it''s fading into OOF, which isnt necessarily a bad thing but with shots like this you normally expect the entire shot to be in full focus or the depth of field more noticably shallow.</td>', 'Not sure of the significance of the mixed background but it doesnt really look out of place, just different. The lighting isnt bad, the composition is fine, the focus is ok but the left hand side looks like it''s fading into OOF, which isnt necessarily a bad thing but with shots like this you normally expect the entire shot to be in full focus or the depth of field more noticably shallow.', '2004-07-21 12:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
