(820180, 92678, 6008, '<td valign="top">The color of the chocolate, the swirl, the use of the hazelnuts to break up the image, and the wonderful color addition of the leaf are all great. The focus is good, as is the lighting, and I like the full frame close up. This could work very well as a promotional image for the chocolate.</td>', 'The color of the chocolate, the swirl, the use of the hazelnuts to break up the image, and the wonderful color addition of the leaf are all great. The focus is good, as is the lighting, and I like the full frame close up. This could work very well as a promotional image for the chocolate.', '2004-07-21 12:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
