(820372, 92565, 9581, '<td valign="top">Very good in focus and detail, I also love black for background.  One of my most difficult things to achieve is good lighting and I think that here some other lighting would help take glares off the sides of the foil kisses. I have learned that even a lamp with a shade or paper between subject and light helps.</td>', 'Very good in focus and detail, I also love black for background.  One of my most difficult things to achieve is good lighting and I think that here some other lighting would help take glares off the sides of the foil kisses. I have learned that even a lamp with a shade or paper between subject and light helps.', '2004-07-21 14:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(820376, 92699, 19608, '<td valign="top">You''ve created a very well-done B&amp;W - good tonal range from white whites to black blacks.  Compositionally - I don''t like the lock of hair - but it does hide the bright white t-shirt.  The drips of cnocolate on the table add a nice touch.  The use of drug appartus to make your point is both clever and bothersome.</td>', 'You''ve created a very well-done B&W - good tonal range from white whites to black blacks.  Compositionally - I don''t like the lock of hair - but it does hide the bright white t-shirt.  The drips of cnocolate on the table add a nice touch.  The use of drug appartus to make your point is both clever and bothersome.', '2004-07-21 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
