(820641, 92550, 24169, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a little too much reflection off the choclate but it''s still effective.</td>', 'I think there''s a little too much reflection off the choclate but it''s still effective.', '2004-07-21 16:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(820642, 92581, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very clever.</td>', 'Very clever.', '2004-07-21 16:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(820643, 91771, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done! So luscious I want to lick my screen! You''ve captured texture and colour beautifully and the background works surprisingly well. The droplet too is just the right length and shape. Composition, with the angle of the strawberry just so, is excellent. A really professional image.</td>', 'Beautifully done! So luscious I want to lick my screen! You''ve captured texture and colour beautifully and the background works surprisingly well. The droplet too is just the right length and shape. Composition, with the angle of the strawberry just so, is excellent. A really professional image.', '2004-07-21 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(820647, 92552, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF and like the choice of angle. Looks just like the kind of image I see in the higher quality food related magazines.</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF and like the choice of angle. Looks just like the kind of image I see in the higher quality food related magazines.', '2004-07-21 17:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(820649, 92276, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the poured chocolate though just a touch too dark for my tastes on the bar. Nice composition. I want some!</td>', 'Nice lighting on the poured chocolate though just a touch too dark for my tastes on the bar. Nice composition. I want some!', '2004-07-21 17:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(820651, 92405, 24169, '<td valign="top">Nicely bordered.</td>', 'Nicely bordered.', '2004-07-21 17:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(820655, 92163, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very cute subject. Good idea.</td>', 'Very cute subject. Good idea.', '2004-07-21 17:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(820656, 92576, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely arranged and a good generous supply! A little boring on it''s own but perhaps might be used in an advert with prominent text over a faded version? Even with the spiral it just seems to lack a focal point for me.</td>', 'Nicely arranged and a good generous supply! A little boring on it''s own but perhaps might be used in an advert with prominent text over a faded version? Even with the spiral it just seems to lack a focal point for me.', '2004-07-21 17:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(820657, 92240, 3087, '<td valign="top">No but I still want some. Nicely done and the tin area would be great for text were this part of an advert.</td>', 'No but I still want some. Nicely done and the tin area would be great for text were this part of an advert.', '2004-07-21 17:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(820660, 92005, 24169, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea and well executed. Love it! Everything seems perfect, composition, lighting, all down to the drip of chocolate on the end of the syringe!</td>', 'A very clever idea and well executed. Love it! Everything seems perfect, composition, lighting, all down to the drip of chocolate on the end of the syringe!', '2004-07-21 17:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(820661, 92242, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nice idea but doesn''t quite work for me.<br/>a) The texture of the chocolate is not appealing - it looks congealed. It''s also smeared up inside the egg shell just above the surface of itself. Also looks too dark and reddish. <br/>b) The background material colour and texture is too prominent.<br/>c) The cutlery is somewhat mismatched and distracts (me) from the concept itself.<br/></td>', 'A nice idea but doesn''t quite work for me.a) The texture of the chocolate is not appealing - it looks congealed. It''s also smeared up inside the egg shell just above the surface of itself. Also looks too dark and reddish. b) The background material colour and texture is too prominent.c) The cutlery is somewhat mismatched and distracts (me) from the concept itself.', '2004-07-21 17:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(820663, 92578, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.</td>', 'Very artistic.', '2004-07-21 17:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(820664, 92690, 3087, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmmmmm! The idea is very appealing - I''d love one of those bananas. The image itself is somewhat flat/ visually bland.</td>', 'Mmmmmmmmm! The idea is very appealing - I''d love one of those bananas. The image itself is somewhat flat/ visually bland.', '2004-07-21 17:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(820665, 92287, 21362, '<td valign="top">Whatever these things are (this is the third one I''ve seen) I want it!! Looks yummy.<br/> <br/>I think this photo needs a deeper DOF. I had the same trouble on my photo so I know it''s difficult with a close up!</td>', 'Whatever these things are (this is the third one I''ve seen) I want it!! Looks yummy. I think this photo needs a deeper DOF. I had the same trouble on my photo so I know it''s difficult with a close up!', '2004-07-21 17:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(820666, 92410, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract feel of this - it''s as much about the fluidity and shapes as about chocolate.</td>', 'I like the abstract feel of this - it''s as much about the fluidity and shapes as about chocolate.', '2004-07-21 17:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(820668, 92546, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours and detail. Not keen on the water either on strawberry, chocolate or surface. Composition is not particularly strong. Maybe having the two strawberries at a more varied angle from each other?</td>', 'Great colours and detail. Not keen on the water either on strawberry, chocolate or surface. Composition is not particularly strong. Maybe having the two strawberries at a more varied angle from each other?', '2004-07-21 17:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(820669, 92354, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2004-07-21 17:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(820670, 92616, 24169, '<td valign="top">It made me smile! :) Nice photo too. . .</td>', 'It made me smile! :) Nice photo too. . .', '2004-07-21 17:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(820672, 92450, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured but still the image doesn''t work for me. Feels slightly tilted, feels much too tight within the frame - would be better cropped much MORE tightly to lose some of the glass edge than as now with the glass touching the edge of the frame.</td>', 'Nicely captured but still the image doesn''t work for me. Feels slightly tilted, feels much too tight within the frame - would be better cropped much MORE tightly to lose some of the glass edge than as now with the glass touching the edge of the frame.', '2004-07-21 17:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(820674, 91633, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Well focused and the red is vibrant!</td>', 'Very nice. Well focused and the red is vibrant!', '2004-07-21 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(820675, 92585, 3087, '<td valign="top">Mmmm! Looks delicious and I like the use of the flower to add colour and compositional interest. Feels too closely cropped at the top.</td>', 'Mmmm! Looks delicious and I like the use of the flower to add colour and compositional interest. Feels too closely cropped at the top.', '2004-07-21 17:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(820679, 91787, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice to go close and I like the resulting composition with the dark curved corner of chocolate. With such shallow DOF I think focus should be on the line where chocolate meets fruit rather than in lower left corner of frame.</td>', 'Nice to go close and I like the resulting composition with the dark curved corner of chocolate. With such shallow DOF I think focus should be on the line where chocolate meets fruit rather than in lower left corner of frame.', '2004-07-21 17:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(820680, 91630, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract effect. Lighting seems a touch yellow.</td>', 'Nice abstract effect. Lighting seems a touch yellow.', '2004-07-21 17:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(820681, 92553, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very clever. What was the light source?</td>', 'Very clever. What was the light source?', '2004-07-21 17:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(820684, 92377, 24169, '<td valign="top">Very effective. Nice lighting, but is that a door I see in the reflection?</td>', 'Very effective. Nice lighting, but is that a door I see in the reflection?', '2004-07-21 17:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(820685, 92562, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! Composition seems a little dull but detail and colour is great!</td>', 'Nice idea! Composition seems a little dull but detail and colour is great!', '2004-07-21 17:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(820687, 92524, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of shallow DOF and subtle lighting. Pale blue background works well. Low viewpoint makes this an almost architectural abstract. Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful use of shallow DOF and subtle lighting. Pale blue background works well. Low viewpoint makes this an almost architectural abstract. Nice job!', '2004-07-21 17:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(820688, 92678, 3087, '<td valign="top">That looks delicious and I really like the dynamic shapes of those swirls. Nice composition with the leaf and hazelnuts.</td>', 'That looks delicious and I really like the dynamic shapes of those swirls. Nice composition with the leaf and hazelnuts.', '2004-07-21 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(820690, 92661, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image - I like the way the shallow DOF turns the massed Kisses into a sparkling background. Not enough chocolate actually on display in it''s nekkid glory for my tastes but a nice image. Would it have been more appealing with a plain coloured surface rather than the slightly dull marble?</td>', 'Nice image - I like the way the shallow DOF turns the massed Kisses into a sparkling background. Not enough chocolate actually on display in it''s nekkid glory for my tastes but a nice image. Would it have been more appealing with a plain coloured surface rather than the slightly dull marble?', '2004-07-21 17:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(820691, 92243, 3087, '<td valign="top">Aaaaaw poor little melted mite! Lighting a little poor and too much banding. Is this over compressed?</td>', 'Aaaaaw poor little melted mite! Lighting a little poor and too much banding. Is this over compressed?', '2004-07-21 17:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(820692, 92534, 18349, '<td valign="top">The date stamp really detracts from this image...</td>', 'The date stamp really detracts from this image...', '2004-07-21 17:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(820693, 92051, 21430, '<td valign="top">The concept is quite nice, but I am unable to see the chocolate so much. It seems overwhelmed by the color from the lighting. It could also be a very dark chocolate, in which case I think a lighter background would showcase it a little more. The gold foil is dominating this image because of the lighting and background choice.</td>', 'The concept is quite nice, but I am unable to see the chocolate so much. It seems overwhelmed by the color from the lighting. It could also be a very dark chocolate, in which case I think a lighter background would showcase it a little more. The gold foil is dominating this image because of the lighting and background choice.', '2004-07-21 17:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(820694, 92614, 22011, '<td valign="top">The green stripe in the back is a little distracting...  What is it?</td>', 'The green stripe in the back is a little distracting...  What is it?', '2004-07-21 17:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(820695, 92642, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the movement - very nice. The reflection of light is wonderful. I''d like the whisk stems to be more accurately vertical. I like the strong grain. Wonderful image!</td>', 'Love the movement - very nice. The reflection of light is wonderful. I''d like the whisk stems to be more accurately vertical. I like the strong grain. Wonderful image!', '2004-07-21 17:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(820696, 92365, 21430, '<td valign="top">I love the way this chocolate looks rocky. It looks as though it will last a very long time, as it is a ''rugged chocolate''. I like the nice plain background and the subtle shadows as well.</td>', 'I love the way this chocolate looks rocky. It looks as though it will last a very long time, as it is a ''rugged chocolate''. I like the nice plain background and the subtle shadows as well.', '2004-07-21 17:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(820697, 92405, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of DOF and of quirky angle. Three itsems together is always visually pleasing and I like the way use it to give depth to the image. The chocolatey surface works well too.</td>', 'Nice choice of DOF and of quirky angle. Three itsems together is always visually pleasing and I like the way use it to give depth to the image. The chocolatey surface works well too.', '2004-07-21 17:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(820698, 92608, 3087, '<td valign="top">It''s not Terry''s - it''s mine!<br/>Nice idea. The plate is disgusting (to me) and doesn''t do anything for the image. I think it would be better to place orange and choc directly on the white surface.</td>', 'It''s not Terry''s - it''s mine!Nice idea. The plate is disgusting (to me) and doesn''t do anything for the image. I think it would be better to place orange and choc directly on the white surface.', '2004-07-21 17:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(820699, 92261, 18349, '<td valign="top">That''s such a great idea...why didn''t I think about it???  Perfect "outside the box" take on the challenge...hope others get it, but I don''t know how many will.  But "I believe in miracles..."  LOL  ;o)</td>', 'That''s such a great idea...why didn''t I think about it???  Perfect "outside the box" take on the challenge...hope others get it, but I don''t know how many will.  But "I believe in miracles..."  LOL  ;o)', '2004-07-21 17:31:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(820703, 92582, 18349, '<td valign="top">A photograph after my own heart with my two favorite things...that''s got to be the tastiest looking entry I''ve come across so far!!!  :o)</td>', 'A photograph after my own heart with my two favorite things...that''s got to be the tastiest looking entry I''ve come across so far!!!  :o)', '2004-07-21 17:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(820704, 92670, 21430, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I really like the fill-flash on the syrup, it really makes the syrup pop in this image. It is also a nice arrangement with a background that compliments the composition.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I really like the fill-flash on the syrup, it really makes the syrup pop in this image. It is also a nice arrangement with a background that compliments the composition.', '2004-07-21 17:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(820705, 92699, 3087, '<td valign="top">Too funny. And his addiction is obviously affecting his finances - he''s injecting the cheap stuff - you don''t know what they cut into that - it''s not pure chocolate you know! Black and white works well!</td>', 'Too funny. And his addiction is obviously affecting his finances - he''s injecting the cheap stuff - you don''t know what they cut into that - it''s not pure chocolate you know! Black and white works well!', '2004-07-21 17:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(820706, 92519, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice sheen on slightly melting chocs. Good use of DOF. Lacks a focal point.</td>', 'Nice sheen on slightly melting chocs. Good use of DOF. Lacks a focal point.', '2004-07-21 17:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(820708, 92613, 20853, '<td valign="top">This is child abuse - just to submit a photo!  :)</td>', 'This is child abuse - just to submit a photo!  :)', '2004-07-21 17:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(820709, 92659, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the low lighting but it''s giving too much of a colour cast. That chocolate unfortunately looks more like fake blood and without the context of the challenge I''d assum it was meant to show an injury. Darker brown might be better, I don''t know...</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the low lighting but it''s giving too much of a colour cast. That chocolate unfortunately looks more like fake blood and without the context of the challenge I''d assum it was meant to show an injury. Darker brown might be better, I don''t know...', '2004-07-21 17:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(820710, 92670, 18349, '<td valign="top">Simply wonderful...wish focus were sharper on the cherry.  Good effort!  ;o)</td>', 'Simply wonderful...wish focus were sharper on the cherry.  Good effort!  ;o)', '2004-07-21 17:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(820711, 92268, 3087, '<td valign="top">Aaaw! Nice idea.</td>', 'Aaaw! Nice idea.', '2004-07-21 17:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(820712, 92578, 3087, '<td valign="top">That''s body painting with a difference. Beautifully painted - and excellent composition. Nice choice to focus on body and shapes rather than include face. Lighting just a touch TOO orange for my tastes.</td>', 'That''s body painting with a difference. Beautifully painted - and excellent composition. Nice choice to focus on body and shapes rather than include face. Lighting just a touch TOO orange for my tastes.', '2004-07-21 17:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(820714, 92239, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done but too fussy. Black and white background, black and white in the cases, round and square, white and dark chocolate... fruit and leaf. Just a little too much for my tastes.</td>', 'Nicely done but too fussy. Black and white background, black and white in the cases, round and square, white and dark chocolate... fruit and leaf. Just a little too much for my tastes.', '2004-07-21 17:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(820715, 92517, 18349, '<td valign="top">Focus is a tad soft on the details of the ring.  Good macro of the kiss.  :o)</td>', 'Focus is a tad soft on the details of the ring.  Good macro of the kiss.  :o)', '2004-07-21 17:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(820716, 92129, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a striking image. I don''t find it sensual but I do find it highly intriguing and very artistic. Very poetic somehow. I think because of the pale face maybe. That eye contact is compelling.</td>', 'What a striking image. I don''t find it sensual but I do find it highly intriguing and very artistic. Very poetic somehow. I think because of the pale face maybe. That eye contact is compelling.', '2004-07-21 17:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(820721, 92358, 19333, '<td valign="top">What''s that "S" on the left? I find it distracting.  Y can see more of the box that I do the chocolates, a higher angle should do the trick.</td>', 'What''s that "S" on the left? I find it distracting.  Y can see more of the box that I do the chocolates, a higher angle should do the trick.', '2004-07-21 17:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(820723, 92382, 19333, '<td valign="top">Too noisy!! I dont think it''s intended grain. To me the foucs seems on the wire, not the chocolate egg.</td>', 'Too noisy!! I dont think it''s intended grain. To me the foucs seems on the wire, not the chocolate egg.', '2004-07-21 17:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(820735, 92663, 19670, '<td valign="top">Is that a ceiling fan? Is there chocolate beneath it? :-)</td>', 'Is that a ceiling fan? Is there chocolate beneath it? :-)', '2004-07-21 18:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(820737, 92396, 19670, '<td valign="top">Um, could be chocolate, could be mud...sorry</td>', 'Um, could be chocolate, could be mud...sorry', '2004-07-21 18:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(820738, 92581, 19670, '<td valign="top">Clever idea!</td>', 'Clever idea!', '2004-07-21 18:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(820750, 91804, 9763, '<td valign="top">Yummy, but sadly, the photo is blurry in many outer areas.  The blue background doesn''t quite enhance the photo entough.  The overall feel of the image isn''t too exciting for me, but you certainly meet the challenge!</td>', 'Yummy, but sadly, the photo is blurry in many outer areas.  The blue background doesn''t quite enhance the photo entough.  The overall feel of the image isn''t too exciting for me, but you certainly meet the challenge!', '2004-07-21 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(820753, 91633, 9763, '<td valign="top">The color and lighting are very nice.  The crop is way too tight though...</td>', 'The color and lighting are very nice.  The crop is way too tight though...', '2004-07-21 18:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(820756, 92272, 9763, '<td valign="top">You meet the challenge, but for some reason, the fudge just doesn''t look that appealing, too shiny I think.  I would like to see it a bit more gooey, or someone eating it.  Maybe stand back and get the entire fudge shop!</td>', 'You meet the challenge, but for some reason, the fudge just doesn''t look that appealing, too shiny I think.  I would like to see it a bit more gooey, or someone eating it.  Maybe stand back and get the entire fudge shop!', '2004-07-21 18:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(820758, 92135, 9763, '<td valign="top">You meet the challenge.  I like the idea too.  However, the lighting is a bit off.  I think the background would be nice if it were blue or tan.  I think the kiss should be lit with a more yellowish light.  The crop is interesting.  I think I''d like to see it with more room on top and less on the bottom.  Also the kiss seems a tiny bit blurry.  I hope this was helpful to you...</td>', 'You meet the challenge.  I like the idea too.  However, the lighting is a bit off.  I think the background would be nice if it were blue or tan.  I think the kiss should be lit with a more yellowish light.  The crop is interesting.  I think I''d like to see it with more room on top and less on the bottom.  Also the kiss seems a tiny bit blurry.  I hope this was helpful to you...', '2004-07-21 18:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(820759, 92643, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  Great color, yummy for sure!  I think the only thing I would change is the lighting.  I''d add some light to the bottom of the berry.  Other than that, it''s perfect!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  Great color, yummy for sure!  I think the only thing I would change is the lighting.  I''d add some light to the bottom of the berry.  Other than that, it''s perfect!', '2004-07-21 18:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(820760, 92502, 9763, '<td valign="top">It might be chocolate, but it hardly looks like it.  It doesn''t scream yum, and I would prefer a photo of chocolate to scream yum!!!  It''s a bit blurry too and the color is not too enticing.  THe crop is nice though.</td>', 'It might be chocolate, but it hardly looks like it.  It doesn''t scream yum, and I would prefer a photo of chocolate to scream yum!!!  It''s a bit blurry too and the color is not too enticing.  THe crop is nice though.', '2004-07-21 18:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(820763, 91706, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great crop!  I would like ot see patties more clearly though, they seem a bit blurry.  This would be an excellent photo if it were clear and a tiny bit brighter.  Great job!</td>', 'Great crop!  I would like ot see patties more clearly though, they seem a bit blurry.  This would be an excellent photo if it were clear and a tiny bit brighter.  Great job!', '2004-07-21 18:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(820765, 91885, 9763, '<td valign="top">I think studio lighting would work better for this shot than natural lighting.  Everything that should be yummy looks a little drab.  The top right corner is distracting because it''s different, and the berries seem too far out of reach.  I think a good photo would have them a little closer to the viewer, who wants to eat them.  Nice color though!</td>', 'I think studio lighting would work better for this shot than natural lighting.  Everything that should be yummy looks a little drab.  The top right corner is distracting because it''s different, and the berries seem too far out of reach.  I think a good photo would have them a little closer to the viewer, who wants to eat them.  Nice color though!', '2004-07-21 18:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(820766, 92422, 9763, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit blurry and though it is chocolate, it''s not too enticing.  I think a photo of chocolate should be a little more enticing, make you salivate!  :)  Nice colors though.</td>', 'Seems a bit blurry and though it is chocolate, it''s not too enticing.  I think a photo of chocolate should be a little more enticing, make you salivate!  :)  Nice colors though.', '2004-07-21 18:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(820767, 91994, 9763, '<td valign="top">Cute!  But the closest of the milk duds is blurry and  your eye is drawn to it as a viewer.  I think the lighting could be more evenly distributed throughout as well.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'Cute!  But the closest of the milk duds is blurry and  your eye is drawn to it as a viewer.  I think the lighting could be more evenly distributed throughout as well.  Nice idea though.', '2004-07-21 18:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(820768, 92567, 9763, '<td valign="top">Is this a chocolate frog?  I wouldn''t want to eat it.  I think it''s a cute frog, but I am drawn to it instead of the chocolate, which is the subject challenged.  So, I don''t really feel this is a chocolatey photo overall.  I like the crop though.</td>', 'Is this a chocolate frog?  I wouldn''t want to eat it.  I think it''s a cute frog, but I am drawn to it instead of the chocolate, which is the subject challenged.  So, I don''t really feel this is a chocolatey photo overall.  I like the crop though.', '2004-07-21 18:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(820770, 92365, 9763, '<td valign="top">I believe you that it''s chocolate, but it sure doesn''t look enticing.  I would not want a photo of this on my wall, no offense.  I would prefer to see this chocolate a little more smooth or gooey.  Though it may taste good, I can''t imagine it.  The photo does not draw me in.  I like the crop, composition and color, but the lighting could be brighter I think, more contrast too...</td>', 'I believe you that it''s chocolate, but it sure doesn''t look enticing.  I would not want a photo of this on my wall, no offense.  I would prefer to see this chocolate a little more smooth or gooey.  Though it may taste good, I can''t imagine it.  The photo does not draw me in.  I like the crop, composition and color, but the lighting could be brighter I think, more contrast too...', '2004-07-21 18:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(820771, 91794, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice color, composition, crop and the challenge is met.  It''s a little bright though, just a little.  I think it needs a warmer light...</td>', 'Very nice color, composition, crop and the challenge is met.  It''s a little bright though, just a little.  I think it needs a warmer light...', '2004-07-21 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(820773, 92377, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very yummy!!!  Great composition, crop, color and idea!  I think it would be perfect if there was another light source shining on the chocolate at the bottom from the front/right side.</td>', 'Very yummy!!!  Great composition, crop, color and idea!  I think it would be perfect if there was another light source shining on the chocolate at the bottom from the front/right side.', '2004-07-21 18:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
