(820846, 92240, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the context here.  Cocolate bread straight out of the oven, you can feel the warmth because of the golden light and the dark recesses of the oven make a good background.  Wish you had a greater depth of focus - the front edge of the pan and the bread are too soft.</td>', 'I like the lighting and the context here.  Cocolate bread straight out of the oven, you can feel the warmth because of the golden light and the dark recesses of the oven make a good background.  Wish you had a greater depth of focus - the front edge of the pan and the bread are too soft.', '2004-07-21 19:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
