(820849, 92607, 7628, '<td valign="top">The chocolate dusting on top of the milk foam is a great subject.  I wish the foam and chocolate were in better focus, the highly decorated cup is beautiful, but draws attention away from the subject, and the background is unremarkable but distracting for all the textural and tonal variations - it would work better if it were blurred.  I do like how you composed the cup to the corner and not dead center.</td>', 'The chocolate dusting on top of the milk foam is a great subject.  I wish the foam and chocolate were in better focus, the highly decorated cup is beautiful, but draws attention away from the subject, and the background is unremarkable but distracting for all the textural and tonal variations - it would work better if it were blurred.  I do like how you composed the cup to the corner and not dead center.', '2004-07-21 19:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(820850, 91881, 7628, '<td valign="top">A lovely idea - I like the contrast between the darkand light and all those interesting curves, but it is entirely out of focus!  What a shame!</td>', 'A lovely idea - I like the contrast between the darkand light and all those interesting curves, but it is entirely out of focus!  What a shame!', '2004-07-21 19:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(820851, 92303, 7628, '<td valign="top">If you could have lit the white chocolate better - at an angle so you''d get shadows and definition in the "Cote D''or" lettering, the white would stad out better.</td>', 'If you could have lit the white chocolate better - at an angle so you''d get shadows and definition in the "Cote D''or" lettering, the white would stad out better.', '2004-07-21 19:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(820853, 91640, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of these flames, I like the blue edges and the swirling blur, good timing - the golden cup is a perfect "crucible."  The stick in the bottom left distracts me, what is it?</td>', 'Nice capture of these flames, I like the blue edges and the swirling blur, good timing - the golden cup is a perfect "crucible."  The stick in the bottom left distracts me, what is it?', '2004-07-21 19:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(820855, 92568, 7628, '<td valign="top">Chaplin should have used eclairs! Much yummier than potatos.  I like your idea - it creates a funny mood, a unique story.  The lighting is a bit harsh tho'' - creating those distratcing shadows.  A couple of lights from the sides with a warmer glow would create more of a diningroom feel.</td>', 'Chaplin should have used eclairs! Much yummier than potatos.  I like your idea - it creates a funny mood, a unique story.  The lighting is a bit harsh tho'' - creating those distratcing shadows.  A couple of lights from the sides with a warmer glow would create more of a diningroom feel.', '2004-07-21 19:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(820857, 92287, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the swirl of creamy material and how it complements the flake chocolate.  If your depth of focus were greater you''d have better impact - only a small middle section of this is in focus.  It is also a bit dark and lacking in contracting lighting.</td>', 'I like the swirl of creamy material and how it complements the flake chocolate.  If your depth of focus were greater you''d have better impact - only a small middle section of this is in focus.  It is also a bit dark and lacking in contracting lighting.', '2004-07-21 19:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
