(820863, 92015, 7628, '<td valign="top">A simple subject, an elegant composition.  I love the personality show, the anticipation!  Lovely b&amp;w very balanced with the face at one side and the chocolate not quite all the way tothe other side.  The arms folded on the table create a nice horizontal line connecting them.  Maybe just a tad sharper or more contrast? 9</td>', 'A simple subject, an elegant composition.  I love the personality show, the anticipation!  Lovely b&w very balanced with the face at one side and the chocolate not quite all the way tothe other side.  The arms folded on the table create a nice horizontal line connecting them.  Maybe just a tad sharper or more contrast? 9', '2004-07-21 19:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
