(821067, 92578, 13772, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I like the design that you painted. I think it would have greater impact in landscape so it looks more like she is laying down and not standing up. I think that this should get a ribbon. Good luck!</td>', 'Great picture! I like the design that you painted. I think it would have greater impact in landscape so it looks more like she is laying down and not standing up. I think that this should get a ribbon. Good luck!', '2004-07-21 22:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
