(821085, 92450, 16106, '<td valign="top">Its not much of a chocolate shot but it is enough of a drop shot to warrant an 8. Only  3 out of 5 for chocotlatyness but full marks for the shot iteslf, I hope you gave details on how you got this great shot.</td>', 'Its not much of a chocolate shot but it is enough of a drop shot to warrant an 8. Only  3 out of 5 for chocotlatyness but full marks for the shot iteslf, I hope you gave details on how you got this great shot.', '2004-07-21 22:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
