(821105, 92354, 24324, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely very interesting. But the one on the right looks a little too blurry and I''m not sure if the blue tinge on the outline of it is intentional.</td>', 'It''s definitely very interesting. But the one on the right looks a little too blurry and I''m not sure if the blue tinge on the outline of it is intentional.', '2004-07-21 23:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
