(821111, 92552, 24324, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Maybe make the rear of the ice cream more in focus too?<br/> <br/>Very appealing, though. :)</td>', 'Very nice. Maybe make the rear of the ice cream more in focus too? Very appealing, though. :)', '2004-07-21 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
