(821501, 92568, 20540, '<td valign="top">Over exposed maybe?  Hands are too bright and the shadows are distracting.  One fork reflects bright, almost too bright, and the other has a green tint that draws away attention.</td>', 'Over exposed maybe?  Hands are too bright and the shadows are distracting.  One fork reflects bright, almost too bright, and the other has a green tint that draws away attention.', '2004-07-22 05:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(821504, 92501, 23016, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. It''s not so evident that it''s made of chocolate.</td>', 'Nice photo. It''s not so evident that it''s made of chocolate.', '2004-07-22 05:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(821508, 92663, 22392, '<td valign="top">i can''t make out what it is.</td>', 'i can''t make out what it is.', '2004-07-22 06:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(821512, 92659, 18349, '<td valign="top">The premise for this photo is very good...however the color of the chocolate itself, on my monitor, is a bit too red/orange to be truly effective in that regard.  It almost appears "bloodlike" rather than as chocolate.  This, of course, could be my monitor.   The placement of the hand is a bit awkward...perhaps, instead of his own hand, a feminine hand, or his and hers?  Possibilities abound.  Lighting is good, just a tad harsh on the left edge.  The lines and composition are nice...I think a lot of photographers forget how sensual the curves and lines of the male physique can be, as most are more interested in females.  Thanks for this reminder to us all.  Great effort.  :o)</td>', 'The premise for this photo is very good...however the color of the chocolate itself, on my monitor, is a bit too red/orange to be truly effective in that regard.  It almost appears "bloodlike" rather than as chocolate.  This, of course, could be my monitor.   The placement of the hand is a bit awkward...perhaps, instead of his own hand, a feminine hand, or his and hers?  Possibilities abound.  Lighting is good, just a tad harsh on the left edge.  The lines and composition are nice...I think a lot of photographers forget how sensual the curves and lines of the male physique can be, as most are more interested in females.  Thanks for this reminder to us all.  Great effort.  :o)', '2004-07-22 06:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(821528, 92553, 23016, '<td valign="top">Good idea and preparation. probably i wouldn''t crop the top of the photo, anyway good work!</td>', 'Good idea and preparation. probably i wouldn''t crop the top of the photo, anyway good work!', '2004-07-22 07:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
