(821608, 92542, 14671, '<td valign="top">The bottom half of the picture looks to be out of focus.  Nice clarity on the top half.  A picture I would expect to see inside a chocolate shop.  well done. &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'The bottom half of the picture looks to be out of focus.  Nice clarity on the top half.  A picture I would expect to see inside a chocolate shop.  well done. <8>', '2004-07-22 09:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
