(821617, 92540, 14671, '<td valign="top">Not a very apealing picture in my opinion.  It looks messy.  great clarity and color but not something I would hang on a wall. &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Not a very apealing picture in my opinion.  It looks messy.  great clarity and color but not something I would hang on a wall. <6>', '2004-07-22 09:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
