(821697, 92396, 22922, '<td valign="top">Too dark, I see a bit of texture, but nothing that I can identify.  Maybe on a white background this would work better. Also has a lot of graininess in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'Too dark, I see a bit of texture, but nothing that I can identify.  Maybe on a white background this would work better. Also has a lot of graininess in the bottom right corner.', '2004-07-22 10:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
