(822651, 91977, 20029, '<td valign="top">I think this is the cutest picture. In my opinion it meats the challengee in the following ways: <br/>Its chocolate but in a different form. <br/>Its in focus<br/>Its humorous<br/>I didn''t like it in the following ways:<br/>Its a little blown out on the cow closest to the camera<br/>its its too dark on the right from the heads down<br/>the grass needs a little work (but I won''t count that against you)<br/> <br/>Over all though I think this is a very cute picture and I am going to give it a 7</td>', 'I think this is the cutest picture. In my opinion it meats the challengee in the following ways: Its chocolate but in a different form. Its in focusIts humorousI didn''t like it in the following ways:Its a little blown out on the cow closest to the cameraits its too dark on the right from the heads downthe grass needs a little work (but I won''t count that against you) Over all though I think this is a very cute picture and I am going to give it a 7', '2004-07-23 00:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
