(822781, 91977, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - I can see all the "literal'' voters crying about not meeting the challenge.  But, indeed chocolate is a color too... Hope they don''t do you in.<br/> <br/>As for the image - it''s a nice rural scene - but way too busy and without a single point to land on.  The windmill breaks up the sky very nicely - and the tree below is also nice.  I guess it just needs less dense cows....</td>', 'Well - I can see all the "literal'' voters crying about not meeting the challenge.  But, indeed chocolate is a color too... Hope they don''t do you in. As for the image - it''s a nice rural scene - but way too busy and without a single point to land on.  The windmill breaks up the sky very nicely - and the tree below is also nice.  I guess it just needs less dense cows....', '2004-07-23 02:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(822783, 92608, 19608, '<td valign="top">Clever, clever - must have taken some work to put that together.  Good composition - nice exposure.  A plainer plate would prpobably work better.</td>', 'Clever, clever - must have taken some work to put that together.  Good composition - nice exposure.  A plainer plate would prpobably work better.', '2004-07-23 02:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
