(822787, 92556, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting take on the challenge - I never would have suspected someone would use B&amp;W for this.  The lighting needs to be softened down a lot - and more DoF would help as well.</td>', 'It''s an interesting take on the challenge - I never would have suspected someone would use B&W for this.  The lighting needs to be softened down a lot - and more DoF would help as well.', '2004-07-23 02:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
