(823178, 92700, 14986, '<td valign="top">The emphasis here isn''t on the ice cream (chocolate) but on the man.   It would probably help, I think, if the icecream itself showed more chocolate.  Not a bad candid snapshot, but not knowing the person, this composition and lighting don''t catch my interest at all.</td>', 'The emphasis here isn''t on the ice cream (chocolate) but on the man.   It would probably help, I think, if the icecream itself showed more chocolate.  Not a bad candid snapshot, but not knowing the person, this composition and lighting don''t catch my interest at all.', '2004-07-23 13:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(823180, 91640, 14986, '<td valign="top">That''s a really cool effect, but I don''t see any chocolate.   Without the title  the viewer has no connection to chocolate.  Still, I think it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'That''s a really cool effect, but I don''t see any chocolate.   Without the title  the viewer has no connection to chocolate.  Still, I think it''s a nice photo.', '2004-07-23 13:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
