(823185, 92667, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.   The lighting could be improved I think.   The blue in the bottom left corner is distracting to me and the overall yellowish tinit is a bit much.</td>', 'Cool shot.   The lighting could be improved I think.   The blue in the bottom left corner is distracting to me and the overall yellowish tinit is a bit much.', '2004-07-23 13:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(823186, 91633, 16256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.</td>', 'Beautiful composition.', '2004-07-23 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(823188, 92578, 14986, '<td valign="top">A naked body and chocolate is bound to be a ribbon winner.   Pretty cool effect...I especially like that you did a design rather than just smearing it on.   The angle and lighting is also good.  Overall, it really doesn''t do too much for me, but I think it will score well.</td>', 'A naked body and chocolate is bound to be a ribbon winner.   Pretty cool effect...I especially like that you did a design rather than just smearing it on.   The angle and lighting is also good.  Overall, it really doesn''t do too much for me, but I think it will score well.', '2004-07-23 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
