(823195, 92415, 14986, '<td valign="top">I just don''t find a person''s open mouth with food in it to be appealing at all.  Sorry.   The photo itself is technically fine,   I think.   Good focus and plenty of lighting.</td>', 'I just don''t find a person''s open mouth with food in it to be appealing at all.  Sorry.   The photo itself is technically fine,   I think.   Good focus and plenty of lighting.', '2004-07-23 13:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(823198, 92682, 14986, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the chocolate in this shot doesn''t look appealing to me.    The background seems somewhat busy, although I do like the dof.</td>', 'For some reason, the chocolate in this shot doesn''t look appealing to me.    The background seems somewhat busy, although I do like the dof.', '2004-07-23 13:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
