(823201, 91794, 14986, '<td valign="top">Nice clear photo and I really like the orangish-red background.  I''m not crazy about the composition as it doesn''t hold my interest.   I think it''s all placed pretty well, it''s just not very different or creative.</td>', 'Nice clear photo and I really like the orangish-red background.  I''m not crazy about the composition as it doesn''t hold my interest.   I think it''s all placed pretty well, it''s just not very different or creative.', '2004-07-23 13:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(823202, 92616, 10720, '<td valign="top">What a great idea, only problem is the folds in the table cloth take away from the image, as to the little spots by the knife. I really like the angle and the DOF, plus the white balance seems right on.</td>', 'What a great idea, only problem is the folds in the table cloth take away from the image, as to the little spots by the knife. I really like the angle and the DOF, plus the white balance seems right on.', '2004-07-23 13:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(823203, 92680, 14986, '<td valign="top">We can all relate to that one I think!  I like the photo and the title...they go together really well.   It definitely fits the challenge.    I think I would crop a little bit off of the bottom to reduce the amound of washed out white on the bottom left.  I think I would crop it right in the middle of the darkest shadow of the fold.</td>', 'We can all relate to that one I think!  I like the photo and the title...they go together really well.   It definitely fits the challenge.    I think I would crop a little bit off of the bottom to reduce the amound of washed out white on the bottom left.  I think I would crop it right in the middle of the darkest shadow of the fold.', '2004-07-23 13:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(823204, 92405, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, composition &amp; lighting. Overall - beautiful shot.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, composition & lighting. Overall - beautiful shot.', '2004-07-23 13:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(823205, 91949, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think that might be  a blood sugar meter, but I''m not sure.   It would make sense with the title, but I''m not sure how many people would know that.  <br/> <br/>The photo itself is nice and clear with good focus, colors and okay lighting I think.</td>', 'I think that might be  a blood sugar meter, but I''m not sure.   It would make sense with the title, but I''m not sure how many people would know that.   The photo itself is nice and clear with good focus, colors and okay lighting I think.', '2004-07-23 13:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(823207, 91630, 14986, '<td valign="top">That is cool looking chocolate, although I''ve never heard of them befoe.   Personally, I would have liked the dof greater to get it all in focus.   Cool abstract look though.</td>', 'That is cool looking chocolate, although I''ve never heard of them befoe.   Personally, I would have liked the dof greater to get it all in focus.   Cool abstract look though.', '2004-07-23 13:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(823210, 91582, 14986, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t like this shot at all.  The chocolate on the bag doesn''t make sense at all to me (why would there be dripping chocolate on that bag?)  The  Hershey bar is obscured qute a bit by the blue crinkly stuff.   The lighting looks dim and the colors (what color is there) bland and washed out.    I don''t think this set up really works with so much going on...the bag, drips, blue crinkly stuff and half seen Hershey bar.  Sorry.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t like this shot at all.  The chocolate on the bag doesn''t make sense at all to me (why would there be dripping chocolate on that bag?)  The  Hershey bar is obscured qute a bit by the blue crinkly stuff.   The lighting looks dim and the colors (what color is there) bland and washed out.    I don''t think this set up really works with so much going on...the bag, drips, blue crinkly stuff and half seen Hershey bar.  Sorry.', '2004-07-23 13:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(823215, 92092, 14986, '<td valign="top">This looks wonderful!  I''m assuming the 42 yrs. reference is for an anniversary or some sort, but I don''t think it goes well with the photo.  Personally, I would have totally cropped out the rose and the ring and focused more sharply on the cheesecake / pie piece.  I like the addition of the berries.   That piece of cheesecake or whatever is really pretty and I think it should be on a more plain plate and have it be the main focus of the photo.   Maybe with a foirk cutting into it or something?</td>', 'This looks wonderful!  I''m assuming the 42 yrs. reference is for an anniversary or some sort, but I don''t think it goes well with the photo.  Personally, I would have totally cropped out the rose and the ring and focused more sharply on the cheesecake / pie piece.  I like the addition of the berries.   That piece of cheesecake or whatever is really pretty and I think it should be on a more plain plate and have it be the main focus of the photo.   Maybe with a foirk cutting into it or something?', '2004-07-23 13:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(823218, 92645, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice try, but I find all the little reflections to be very distracting.</td>', 'I think this is a nice try, but I find all the little reflections to be very distracting.', '2004-07-23 13:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(823223, 92561, 14986, '<td valign="top">I like the tear-away effect.  I like a photo with something to say, and this one does have a message while still connecting to the challenge.   So far one of my top ten picks.    I do think the upper right section has a lot of stuff going on that is a little distracting.</td>', 'I like the tear-away effect.  I like a photo with something to say, and this one does have a message while still connecting to the challenge.   So far one of my top ten picks.    I do think the upper right section has a lot of stuff going on that is a little distracting.', '2004-07-23 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(823225, 92639, 14986, '<td valign="top">Yum.   Well done shot, but I think it''s a little boring.</td>', 'Yum.   Well done shot, but I think it''s a little boring.', '2004-07-23 13:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(823230, 91950, 14986, '<td valign="top">Oh man...good think I have chocolate on hand while scoring this challenge!   My daughter had this same exact idea, but I didn''t do it (don''t have an entry this time.)   I think you''ve done well with this one.  What I would change is to have the whole thing in focus and I would fill the frame totally with the chocolate mixture - no bowl showing at all.   Would make a cool puzzle that way!</td>', 'Oh man...good think I have chocolate on hand while scoring this challenge!   My daughter had this same exact idea, but I didn''t do it (don''t have an entry this time.)   I think you''ve done well with this one.  What I would change is to have the whole thing in focus and I would fill the frame totally with the chocolate mixture - no bowl showing at all.   Would make a cool puzzle that way!', '2004-07-23 13:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(823234, 92699, 14986, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t relate so much to this, I''d find it appalling!  :)     Good choice to use the b/w.   I think the photo and idea are both good, but not great.</td>', 'If I didn''t relate so much to this, I''d find it appalling!  :)     Good choice to use the b/w.   I think the photo and idea are both good, but not great.', '2004-07-23 14:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(823235, 91787, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the upclose composition on this one.  I think, however, it would have been better with a sharper focus and more fluid looking chocolate.</td>', 'I really like the upclose composition on this one.  I think, however, it would have been better with a sharper focus and more fluid looking chocolate.', '2004-07-23 14:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(823240, 92391, 14986, '<td valign="top">I think you tried to do too much with this one.  I like the idea of the "Got MIlk" but I think the point would have come across better with t closer shot of just that yummy looking cake and a cold glass of milk.  Also, the yellowish tone here I think makes the milk (or is that a milkshake?), and the mie topping much less appealing.    I like you idea, though.</td>', 'I think you tried to do too much with this one.  I like the idea of the "Got MIlk" but I think the point would have come across better with t closer shot of just that yummy looking cake and a cold glass of milk.  Also, the yellowish tone here I think makes the milk (or is that a milkshake?), and the mie topping much less appealing.    I like you idea, though.', '2004-07-23 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(823242, 92552, 23614, '<td valign="top">Very nice. One of my favorites. The focus is sharp on the ice cream and chocolate!!</td>', 'Very nice. One of my favorites. The focus is sharp on the ice cream and chocolate!!', '2004-07-23 14:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(823246, 91563, 14986, '<td valign="top">I should have taken out stock in Hershey for this challenge! :)    Fun idea, but I would have preferred to see it done in a more artistic  or creative way.   The composition could be improved, I think, but at least including all of the smileys (bottom ones are cut off), and I think the lighting here is very uneven and un appealing for the chocolate.  It appears to me that   there''s an overall purplish cast to the photo</td>', 'I should have taken out stock in Hershey for this challenge! :)    Fun idea, but I would have preferred to see it done in a more artistic  or creative way.   The composition could be improved, I think, but at least including all of the smileys (bottom ones are cut off), and I think the lighting here is very uneven and un appealing for the chocolate.  It appears to me that   there''s an overall purplish cast to the photo', '2004-07-23 14:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(823247, 92540, 14986, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting and clarity of this shot, but the set up really doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'I really like the lighting and clarity of this shot, but the set up really doesn''t do anything for me.', '2004-07-23 14:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
