(823250, 92266, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t "get" the title at all, or why there''s a ring on the chocolate.  The photo itself seems to have an overall yellowish tint so that nothing really stands out.   The positioning of the chocolate over the edge of the table gives that shadow, which I don''t think helps the shot.</td>', 'I don''t "get" the title at all, or why there''s a ring on the chocolate.  The photo itself seems to have an overall yellowish tint so that nothing really stands out.   The positioning of the chocolate over the edge of the table gives that shadow, which I don''t think helps the shot.', '2004-07-23 14:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
