(823261, 92089, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice product shot.  I like the clarity and the composition okay.  I wish there was a little better light on the front of the mug.</td>', 'This is a really nice product shot.  I like the clarity and the composition okay.  I wish there was a little better light on the front of the mug.', '2004-07-23 14:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
