(823271, 92678, 14986, '<td valign="top">Good thing I''ve got chocolate on hand while scoring these!   Love the swirls in the chocolate.   The composition here is very appealing to me.  The addition of the nuts and leaf are perfect.   Nice lighting to highlight the chocolate swirls without being distracting.  One of my top choices.</td>', 'Good thing I''ve got chocolate on hand while scoring these!   Love the swirls in the chocolate.   The composition here is very appealing to me.  The addition of the nuts and leaf are perfect.   Nice lighting to highlight the chocolate swirls without being distracting.  One of my top choices.', '2004-07-23 14:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
