(823858, 92585, 20029, '<td valign="top">the flower adds a nice touch to it. it sepporates it from some of the other pictures. keep up the good work! AND...if you made this piece of cake then I think you should consider becoming a chef? maybe? LOL. just kidding, but it does look like a professional baked it! Great job and awsome picture!</td>', 'the flower adds a nice touch to it. it sepporates it from some of the other pictures. keep up the good work! AND...if you made this piece of cake then I think you should consider becoming a chef? maybe? LOL. just kidding, but it does look like a professional baked it! Great job and awsome picture!', '2004-07-24 03:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(823859, 91397, 20029, '<td valign="top">This is my kind of meal! the candles are  a bit distracting and they kind of take away from the picture but I can see the reason for having them there. My suggestion would be to take this shot from the above angle and shooting it strate down. other then that its a great picture and a great idea. Keep up the great work! : )</td>', 'This is my kind of meal! the candles are  a bit distracting and they kind of take away from the picture but I can see the reason for having them there. My suggestion would be to take this shot from the above angle and shooting it strate down. other then that its a great picture and a great idea. Keep up the great work! : )', '2004-07-24 03:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
