(823968, 92407, 23300, '<td valign="top">This has quite a bit of impact. I think the cropping and depth of field work well. It looks like an advertisement. The lighting works quite well too.</td>', 'This has quite a bit of impact. I think the cropping and depth of field work well. It looks like an advertisement. The lighting works quite well too.', '2004-07-24 06:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(823969, 92699, 23300, '<td valign="top">The choice of black and white works really well. The subject is quite bizzare which is enhanced by the cartoon rabbit leering out of the corner of the picture. The lighting, contrast and textures are great. I wonder if the lighting was a bit more " low key" if it would push the "bizzare" angle a little further.</td>', 'The choice of black and white works really well. The subject is quite bizzare which is enhanced by the cartoon rabbit leering out of the corner of the picture. The lighting, contrast and textures are great. I wonder if the lighting was a bit more " low key" if it would push the "bizzare" angle a little further.', '2004-07-24 06:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(823970, 92690, 23300, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. The lighting works really well. I think the little dot of chocolate on the left really adds to the composition.</td>', 'Interesting idea. The lighting works really well. I think the little dot of chocolate on the left really adds to the composition.', '2004-07-24 07:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(823971, 92503, 23300, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the depth of field. The colours work well too. It seems just a touch dark at the front.</td>', 'Love the composition and the depth of field. The colours work well too. It seems just a touch dark at the front.', '2004-07-24 07:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(823972, 91885, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the soft light works well too.</td>', 'I love the composition and the soft light works well too.', '2004-07-24 07:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(823973, 92678, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great image. I love it. The textures and composition work really well and the lighting is excellent. It has a really luxurious feel about it. The swirls are really graceful. This might also work well in black and white. This is one of the best to me.</td>', 'Great image. I love it. The textures and composition work really well and the lighting is excellent. It has a really luxurious feel about it. The swirls are really graceful. This might also work well in black and white. This is one of the best to me.', '2004-07-24 07:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(823974, 92506, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth of field. The lighting works well too. The subject matter certainly gets pushed forward. Its a very stark image, no subtlety about it.</td>', 'Great use of depth of field. The lighting works well too. The subject matter certainly gets pushed forward. Its a very stark image, no subtlety about it.', '2004-07-24 07:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(823976, 92201, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the composition and cropping work well. Its a good idea. The lighting is a bit "hard'' though. The white highlights tend to get the focus of attention. There''s also a hair or something similar in the top left that detracts from the image.</td>', 'I think the composition and cropping work well. Its a good idea. The lighting is a bit "hard'' though. The white highlights tend to get the focus of attention. There''s also a hair or something similar in the top left that detracts from the image.', '2004-07-24 07:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(823978, 91917, 23300, '<td valign="top">The even lighting works well. The leaves around the top certainly enhance the image. This looks like a photograph from a restaurant menu, its well presented.</td>', 'The even lighting works well. The leaves around the top certainly enhance the image. This looks like a photograph from a restaurant menu, its well presented.', '2004-07-24 07:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(823979, 92527, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the use of textures and the balance of colours acheived by the composition. The cropping works well too.</td>', 'I like the use of textures and the balance of colours acheived by the composition. The cropping works well too.', '2004-07-24 07:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(823980, 91372, 23300, '<td valign="top">Wow, a punk easter egg. The lighting works well and the textures compliment each other. I don''t think the central composition helps to enhance the message. The image is quite cute and I wonder if different cropping might have helped to make the image a bit more unique. More space on the top and the right may have made it look a little more "off centre" as it were.</td>', 'Wow, a punk easter egg. The lighting works well and the textures compliment each other. I don''t think the central composition helps to enhance the message. The image is quite cute and I wonder if different cropping might have helped to make the image a bit more unique. More space on the top and the right may have made it look a little more "off centre" as it were.', '2004-07-24 07:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(823981, 92607, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the colouring and textures. The cropping really helps to enhance the frothy texture. The depth of field that softens the wooden bench adds a sort of warm, homely feeling to the image. It makes me think of a hot drink on a cold night. I think a border would really help to finish of the scene.</td>', 'I like the colouring and textures. The cropping really helps to enhance the frothy texture. The depth of field that softens the wooden bench adds a sort of warm, homely feeling to the image. It makes me think of a hot drink on a cold night. I think a border would really help to finish of the scene.', '2004-07-24 07:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(823983, 92626, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting works well in this image. I feel it lacks a clear focal point though. There is a lot going on, a lot of colour and my eye  doesn''t find somewhere to rest. Perhaps a plain plate and having the items arranged to draw the eye toward one particular item would do it.</td>', 'The lighting works well in this image. I feel it lacks a clear focal point though. There is a lot going on, a lot of colour and my eye  doesn''t find somewhere to rest. Perhaps a plain plate and having the items arranged to draw the eye toward one particular item would do it.', '2004-07-24 07:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(823985, 92583, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like this image. Its very stark. The swirls add a load of dynamics to the image. The lighting is good also. I would perhaps suggest it could have had a little more space all the way around just to help to give the swirls a little more room.</td>', 'I like this image. Its very stark. The swirls add a load of dynamics to the image. The lighting is good also. I would perhaps suggest it could have had a little more space all the way around just to help to give the swirls a little more room.', '2004-07-24 07:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(823988, 92416, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great image. Love the lighting and depth of field. The colours are sublime. This is the best image I''ve seen that suggests luxury let alone one of the best I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'Great image. Love the lighting and depth of field. The colours are sublime. This is the best image I''ve seen that suggests luxury let alone one of the best I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2004-07-24 07:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(823993, 92561, 23300, '<td valign="top">I found this image quite odd at first glance. However after looking at it for a moment the contrast between the luxury sweets in the glittering packaging and the stark realities of the hungry third-world become apparent. Then I notice the ominous barcode sitting under the childs face and I think of things like corporate globalization and third-world debt. Is the child peering into a peephole into a strange modern world of consumerism and hectic values or is he disappearing, buried under the refuse of this unforgiving first-world. Your image says these things to me better than anything I could say here in words to you. Well done for making this image.</td>', 'I found this image quite odd at first glance. However after looking at it for a moment the contrast between the luxury sweets in the glittering packaging and the stark realities of the hungry third-world become apparent. Then I notice the ominous barcode sitting under the childs face and I think of things like corporate globalization and third-world debt. Is the child peering into a peephole into a strange modern world of consumerism and hectic values or is he disappearing, buried under the refuse of this unforgiving first-world. Your image says these things to me better than anything I could say here in words to you. Well done for making this image.', '2004-07-24 08:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(824012, 92574, 20407, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t a technically great photo, it really made me laugh and I love looking at it, it makes me happy. Great idea. 8</td>', 'While this isn''t a technically great photo, it really made me laugh and I love looking at it, it makes me happy. Great idea. 8', '2004-07-24 08:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(824013, 92243, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourites - great idea, great lighting. Well done. 8</td>', 'This is one of my favourites - great idea, great lighting. Well done. 8', '2004-07-24 08:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(824014, 92400, 20407, '<td valign="top">Oh, I really want to eat the chocolate - well done. 8</td>', 'Oh, I really want to eat the chocolate - well done. 8', '2004-07-24 08:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(824015, 92015, 20407, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge. Well done. 8</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge. Well done. 8', '2004-07-24 08:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(824016, 92578, 20407, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, looks very tasty - well done. 8</td>', 'Nice lighting, looks very tasty - well done. 8', '2004-07-24 08:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(824017, 92581, 20407, '<td valign="top">Simple, but well done. I really like this. 8</td>', 'Simple, but well done. I really like this. 8', '2004-07-24 08:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
