(824073, 92668, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice even lighting, but a tiny bit of hard shadow on the wall behind the girls head on her right side. Nice composition. Seems to have a slightly yellowish color cast though, but maybe that''s just an illusion.</td>', 'Nice even lighting, but a tiny bit of hard shadow on the wall behind the girls head on her right side. Nice composition. Seems to have a slightly yellowish color cast though, but maybe that''s just an illusion.', '2004-07-24 12:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
