(824730, 92568, 12825, '<td valign="top">I get it but the harsh flash detracts -- also not quite enough chocolate for this challenge. ;-)</td>', 'I get it but the harsh flash detracts -- also not quite enough chocolate for this challenge. ;-)', '2004-07-25 12:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(824738, 92415, 22748, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. The lighting is great, especially inside the mouth where it is a smooth gradient all the way back. Great idea for a picture too.<br/> <br/>There is a slight feeling of pixellation or something, however (noticable for instance on the front face of the chocolate). Since the image is only 39KB, it is probably overcompressed JPEG, causing artifacts. Minus one point for that, but still this gets an 8.</td>', 'This is very nice. The lighting is great, especially inside the mouth where it is a smooth gradient all the way back. Great idea for a picture too. There is a slight feeling of pixellation or something, however (noticable for instance on the front face of the chocolate). Since the image is only 39KB, it is probably overcompressed JPEG, causing artifacts. Minus one point for that, but still this gets an 8.', '2004-07-25 13:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(824741, 92619, 22748, '<td valign="top">This is cool, but the background is too similar in color to the butterfly''s wings, so there isn''t a good separation of the foreground and background.</td>', 'This is cool, but the background is too similar in color to the butterfly''s wings, so there isn''t a good separation of the foreground and background.', '2004-07-25 13:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(824742, 92237, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good usage of DOF and the mainsubject is pretty sharp. The lightning could maybe have been better to give better expression of the texture.  But as I said, very good.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good usage of DOF and the mainsubject is pretty sharp. The lightning could maybe have been better to give better expression of the texture.  But as I said, very good.', '2004-07-25 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(824743, 91278, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good macro with extreamly shallow DOF.  Still the background distracts a litle since it´s such a high contrast.  But the idea is fine and pretty well performed.</td>', 'Good macro with extreamly shallow DOF.  Still the background distracts a litle since it´s such a high contrast.  But the idea is fine and pretty well performed.', '2004-07-25 13:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(824751, 91961, 15919, '<td valign="top">The idea may be fine though I´m not sure it´s very original.  Can´t say the image excites me a lot.  The m´s are pretty unsharp and surely would have tolerated deeper and richer colorsettings.  The backround isn´t either very good for my opinion.</td>', 'The idea may be fine though I´m not sure it´s very original.  Can´t say the image excites me a lot.  The m´s are pretty unsharp and surely would have tolerated deeper and richer colorsettings.  The backround isn´t either very good for my opinion.', '2004-07-25 13:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(824753, 92243, 23962, '<td valign="top">Very lyrical. Great lighting.definately a 9</td>', 'Very lyrical. Great lighting.definately a 9', '2004-07-25 13:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(824755, 92501, 23962, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2004-07-25 13:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(824756, 92365, 23962, '<td valign="top">Wow. I tried sniffing the screen.</td>', 'Wow. I tried sniffing the screen.', '2004-07-25 13:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(824757, 91950, 23962, '<td valign="top">My tummy hurts.</td>', 'My tummy hurts.', '2004-07-25 13:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(824758, 92537, 23962, '<td valign="top">Striking.</td>', 'Striking.', '2004-07-25 13:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(824759, 92561, 23962, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Captain Bringdown.</td>', 'Thanks, Captain Bringdown.', '2004-07-25 13:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(824760, 92380, 15919, '<td valign="top">Not very original, technically badly performed and uninteresting.  I´m not trying to hurt you and I´m sorry if I do but I think you should not spend my time and others bye submitting such images.</td>', 'Not very original, technically badly performed and uninteresting.  I´m not trying to hurt you and I´m sorry if I do but I think you should not spend my time and others bye submitting such images.', '2004-07-25 13:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(824762, 91794, 23962, '<td valign="top">Great colour and composition.</td>', 'Great colour and composition.', '2004-07-25 13:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(824765, 92658, 15919, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like an advertisement for this drink but I think it needs some improvement in setup and technically for you to be able to sell this image to the company.  Think 1/2 or 1 stop longer exposure would have given a better expression and then you can add more contrast, probably you need a better lightning.  Also the WB should without a doubt be much warmer.  The image needs tighter croping from above and from left.  About the setup; the bag and the background paper have obviously been under to much usage to give good expression and are rather distracting.<br/>But good experiment.</td>', 'Looks a bit like an advertisement for this drink but I think it needs some improvement in setup and technically for you to be able to sell this image to the company.  Think 1/2 or 1 stop longer exposure would have given a better expression and then you can add more contrast, probably you need a better lightning.  Also the WB should without a doubt be much warmer.  The image needs tighter croping from above and from left.  About the setup; the bag and the background paper have obviously been under to much usage to give good expression and are rather distracting.But good experiment.', '2004-07-25 13:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(824769, 92574, 15919, '<td valign="top">What is it about m&amp;m´s and hersays?  It´s very good to put some work and effort into images but this isnt very original or well performed.  It´s unsharp, the colorsaturation is dull and the background isnt very good.  If you have PS, PS elements or other usable photoediting program.  Go to Enhance &gt; Adjust brightness/contras &gt; Levels and sett the blackpoint so the background is totaly black.  Sure that would have done something for this pic.   Bye the same method you can increase the contrast pretty well.</td>', 'What is it about m&m´s and hersays?  It´s very good to put some work and effort into images but this isnt very original or well performed.  It´s unsharp, the colorsaturation is dull and the background isnt very good.  If you have PS, PS elements or other usable photoediting program.  Go to Enhance > Adjust brightness/contras > Levels and sett the blackpoint so the background is totaly black.  Sure that would have done something for this pic.   Bye the same method you can increase the contrast pretty well.', '2004-07-25 13:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(824773, 92096, 15919, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice expression of some kind of chocolate texture.  Think the thing on the right adds nothing to the images so why is it inside the imageframe?</td>', 'Pretty nice expression of some kind of chocolate texture.  Think the thing on the right adds nothing to the images so why is it inside the imageframe?', '2004-07-25 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(824774, 92287, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice usage of shallow DOF tought the setup regarding the background sheet could maybe have been better.  Cool lightning.</td>', 'Nice usage of shallow DOF tought the setup regarding the background sheet could maybe have been better.  Cool lightning.', '2004-07-25 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(824775, 91627, 15919, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and good usage of shallow DOF.</td>', 'Cool idea and good usage of shallow DOF.', '2004-07-25 13:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(824777, 92626, 15919, '<td valign="top">Needs better setup and lightning.  The image is pretty unsharp and to small.  Also thing the closer angel where the dishedges would have gone out of the frame would have given a better expression.</td>', 'Needs better setup and lightning.  The image is pretty unsharp and to small.  Also thing the closer angel where the dishedges would have gone out of the frame would have given a better expression.', '2004-07-25 13:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(824779, 92244, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool.  Think that totaly black background would have been still better.</td>', 'This is pretty cool.  Think that totaly black background would have been still better.', '2004-07-25 13:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(824781, 92058, 15919, '<td valign="top">Tighter cropin from below and more contrast wouldn´t have hurt.</td>', 'Tighter cropin from below and more contrast wouldn´t have hurt.', '2004-07-25 13:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(824782, 92382, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is pretty original.  The grain gives it something.  Cool.</td>', 'This is pretty original.  The grain gives it something.  Cool.', '2004-07-25 14:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(824783, 91580, 15919, '<td valign="top">Clean and sharp.  Looks like an advertisement.  Very good.</td>', 'Clean and sharp.  Looks like an advertisement.  Very good.', '2004-07-25 14:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(824784, 92689, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a cute photograph.  It seems as though the chocolate has a large amount of light reflection, but that''s really the only criticism I have to offer.  Good job.</td>', 'This is a cute photograph.  It seems as though the chocolate has a large amount of light reflection, but that''s really the only criticism I have to offer.  Good job.', '2004-07-25 14:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(824785, 92583, 20613, '<td valign="top">This one makes me really hungry ;)  It''s a good photograph; the lighting is a bit off, though.  The left side of the photograph is more lit than the rest of the photograph, so the shadows that exist on the left side are a bit distracting.</td>', 'This one makes me really hungry ;)  It''s a good photograph; the lighting is a bit off, though.  The left side of the photograph is more lit than the rest of the photograph, so the shadows that exist on the left side are a bit distracting.', '2004-07-25 14:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(824786, 92352, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very good idea.  With better ligtning and litle more editing you could have make the background totaly white which I think would make the image still better.  There are also some white refletion spots in the chocolate.  But good idea and fine image.</td>', 'Very good idea.  With better ligtning and litle more editing you could have make the background totaly white which I think would make the image still better.  There are also some white refletion spots in the chocolate.  But good idea and fine image.', '2004-07-25 14:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(824788, 92416, 15919, '<td valign="top">Well lit and exposed.  Some cool and soft expression.</td>', 'Well lit and exposed.  Some cool and soft expression.', '2004-07-25 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(824789, 92552, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic picture; it looks like an advertisement.  I like the dof.  I also like how the subject isn''t only chocolate.  Many people chose to use chocolate bars, but I like the originality involved in this photo.  Great job!  9.</td>', 'This is a fantastic picture; it looks like an advertisement.  I like the dof.  I also like how the subject isn''t only chocolate.  Many people chose to use chocolate bars, but I like the originality involved in this photo.  Great job!  9.', '2004-07-25 14:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(824791, 92405, 20613, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  I like the sharp focus, and I also like your original set up!  9.</td>', 'Great photo!  I like the sharp focus, and I also like your original set up!  9.', '2004-07-25 14:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(824793, 92678, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photograph.  The fact that you used other materials than chocolate grabs my attention more than most of the photographs have.</td>', 'This is an interesting photograph.  The fact that you used other materials than chocolate grabs my attention more than most of the photographs have.', '2004-07-25 14:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(824794, 92391, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a good photograph; it may be a tad overdone, but I like it nonetheless.</td>', 'This is a good photograph; it may be a tad overdone, but I like it nonetheless.', '2004-07-25 14:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(824795, 92580, 20613, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph a lot!  It looks like a beach of chocolate!  Good job.  I really have no criticism to offer.</td>', 'I like this photograph a lot!  It looks like a beach of chocolate!  Good job.  I really have no criticism to offer.', '2004-07-25 14:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(824797, 92673, 20613, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ll admit it.  It took me a few seconds to realize that the chocolate is wrapped in crayon-like wrappers.  I''m a little slow, today.  However, I really like this photograph!!  It''s original and way different than all the others I have seen.  The title is cute, as well.  Great job!  10!</td>', 'Okay, I''ll admit it.  It took me a few seconds to realize that the chocolate is wrapped in crayon-like wrappers.  I''m a little slow, today.  However, I really like this photograph!!  It''s original and way different than all the others I have seen.  The title is cute, as well.  Great job!  10!', '2004-07-25 14:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(824799, 92616, 20613, '<td valign="top">Looking good!  The tablecloth is a bit distracting because of the wrinkles (hey, we all have wrinkly table cloths)  This picture would have probably looked a bit better on a white surface &amp; white background, but it''s a good photo anyway.  8.</td>', 'Looking good!  The tablecloth is a bit distracting because of the wrinkles (hey, we all have wrinkly table cloths)  This picture would have probably looked a bit better on a white surface & white background, but it''s a good photo anyway.  8.', '2004-07-25 14:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(824800, 92581, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is great!  I totally agree :)  I like your original idea; you definitely get points for being original.  I am a bit of a picky voter, so I wouldn''t rate this photo a ten simply because it doesn''t appear to be the best quality; also, I would probably have taken the photo at a different angle.  This is a good photo, though, so I am rating it as a 7.</td>', 'This is great!  I totally agree :)  I like your original idea; you definitely get points for being original.  I am a bit of a picky voter, so I wouldn''t rate this photo a ten simply because it doesn''t appear to be the best quality; also, I would probably have taken the photo at a different angle.  This is a good photo, though, so I am rating it as a 7.', '2004-07-25 14:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(824805, 92390, 20613, '<td valign="top">I like the sharp focus and the clean, white background.  The only difference I would have made if I were taken this photograph is that I would probably have had the hand up higher in the photograph, perhaps on top of the chocolate so that the hand would be a bit less distracting.  Good job, though.  8.</td>', 'I like the sharp focus and the clean, white background.  The only difference I would have made if I were taken this photograph is that I would probably have had the hand up higher in the photograph, perhaps on top of the chocolate so that the hand would be a bit less distracting.  Good job, though.  8.', '2004-07-25 14:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(824806, 92421, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  It''s a little dark and a litle crooked, but I like the idea.  6</td>', 'This is cute.  It''s a little dark and a litle crooked, but I like the idea.  6', '2004-07-25 14:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(824807, 92242, 20613, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Good focus &amp; good idea.  I''m not too sure, however, that I am fond of the lighting.  It looks flash-y.</td>', 'I like this.  Good focus & good idea.  I''m not too sure, however, that I am fond of the lighting.  It looks flash-y.', '2004-07-25 14:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(824808, 92502, 20613, '<td valign="top">Good photo &amp; great lighting!  Also, the focus is nice &amp; sharp.  Great job!  9.</td>', 'Good photo & great lighting!  Also, the focus is nice & sharp.  Great job!  9.', '2004-07-25 14:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(824811, 92326, 20613, '<td valign="top">This photo is a little confusing to me because it seems very dark.  I see the Snickers bar, but the rest is kind of a mystery.  Maybe it''s my monitor?  I''m not really sure.  It may have been easier to see in black and white.</td>', 'This photo is a little confusing to me because it seems very dark.  I see the Snickers bar, but the rest is kind of a mystery.  Maybe it''s my monitor?  I''m not really sure.  It may have been easier to see in black and white.', '2004-07-25 14:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(824812, 92029, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a really great photo.  It is extremely high quality with good focus &amp; the subject obviously totally meets the challenge.  Great job! 9.</td>', 'This is a really great photo.  It is extremely high quality with good focus & the subject obviously totally meets the challenge.  Great job! 9.', '2004-07-25 14:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(824813, 91630, 20613, '<td valign="top">I love abstracty photos like this where there''s a repetitive mood to the photograph.  Great job; the chocolate looks great, the focus is great, and I love your general set up of the photograph.  9</td>', 'I love abstracty photos like this where there''s a repetitive mood to the photograph.  Great job; the chocolate looks great, the focus is great, and I love your general set up of the photograph.  9', '2004-07-25 14:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(824814, 92667, 20613, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but the lighting is off, and there''s too much reflection on the chocolate wrappers.  Also, the photo isn''t the best quality, as it is extremely grainy.</td>', 'I like your idea, but the lighting is off, and there''s too much reflection on the chocolate wrappers.  Also, the photo isn''t the best quality, as it is extremely grainy.', '2004-07-25 14:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(824815, 92312, 20613, '<td valign="top">Good idea &amp; good focus!  I wish I could see the whole hand, though.  6.</td>', 'Good idea & good focus!  I wish I could see the whole hand, though.  6.', '2004-07-25 14:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(824816, 92499, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph!  I love the idea.  This is just an amazing job.  The egg/chocolate is perfectly in focus, the background is perfect, and the idea is great.  Amazing job!  10</td>', 'This is a great photograph!  I love the idea.  This is just an amazing job.  The egg/chocolate is perfectly in focus, the background is perfect, and the idea is great.  Amazing job!  10', '2004-07-25 14:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(824817, 92365, 20613, '<td valign="top">Great photo!  It looks like a cliff of chocolate.  I like how you took chocolate and used an original idea to make it more interesting.  Also, the focus is great &amp; the background is absolutely perfect.  9!</td>', 'Great photo!  It looks like a cliff of chocolate.  I like how you took chocolate and used an original idea to make it more interesting.  Also, the focus is great & the background is absolutely perfect.  9!', '2004-07-25 14:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(824819, 92377, 20613, '<td valign="top">Good shot--the background is great &amp; the idea is really interesting.  Personally, I would have taken the photo from a slightly different angle to try to reduce reflections.  Good photo, though.  7.</td>', 'Good shot--the background is great & the idea is really interesting.  Personally, I would have taken the photo from a slightly different angle to try to reduce reflections.  Good photo, though.  7.', '2004-07-25 14:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(824821, 92497, 20613, '<td valign="top">Great shot--it''s so cute!  Good focus &amp; good idea.  8.</td>', 'Great shot--it''s so cute!  Good focus & good idea.  8.', '2004-07-25 14:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(824822, 91670, 20613, '<td valign="top">Very interesting &amp; very original!  You did an amazing job; I don''t have any constructive criticism to offer.  9.</td>', 'Very interesting & very original!  You did an amazing job; I don''t have any constructive criticism to offer.  9.', '2004-07-25 14:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(824823, 92612, 20613, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, but I am not too sure about the angle of the photograph.  I do like your idea, though.</td>', 'This was a good idea, but I am not too sure about the angle of the photograph.  I do like your idea, though.', '2004-07-25 14:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(824824, 92415, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot.  I wish I could see the whole face, though.</td>', 'This is a good shot.  I wish I could see the whole face, though.', '2004-07-25 14:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(824826, 91771, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot!!  I''m definitely predicting that this will be a top five finisher, if not even better.  I love your dof.  This really is a great macro.  I also love the background &amp; the border that you have added.  Simply amazing!  10!</td>', 'This is an amazing shot!!  I''m definitely predicting that this will be a top five finisher, if not even better.  I love your dof.  This really is a great macro.  I also love the background & the border that you have added.  Simply amazing!  10!', '2004-07-25 14:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(824840, 92354, 22734, '<td valign="top">Fascinating effect. Returning to bump this image higher and higher.</td>', 'Fascinating effect. Returning to bump this image higher and higher.', '2004-07-25 14:57:18.000000', NULL, 1);
