(825994, 92280, 11295, '<td valign="top">This is nicely composed, although you did blow out your highlights a bit as evidenced by the disappearing cap at the top left... probably the place you''d least want something like that.</td>', 'This is nicely composed, although you did blow out your highlights a bit as evidenced by the disappearing cap at the top left... probably the place you''d least want something like that.', '2004-07-26 12:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
