(826002, 92365, 11295, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot... they look like stones, and the ligthing is fabulous... you''ve pulled of a terrific texture shot here. One of my favs for this challenge.</td>', 'I like this one a lot... they look like stones, and the ligthing is fabulous... you''ve pulled of a terrific texture shot here. One of my favs for this challenge.', '2004-07-26 12:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
