(826004, 92015, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the expression :) (9).</td>', 'Love the expression :) (9).', '2004-07-26 12:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(826005, 91372, 11295, '<td valign="top">Pffft! OK, you get points for making me laugh...:)</td>', 'Pffft! OK, you get points for making me laugh...:)', '2004-07-26 12:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(826006, 92646, 5728, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective (9).</td>', 'Simple and effective (9).', '2004-07-26 12:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(826011, 92380, 10858, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say that, but this isn''t really the type of photo I expected for the challenge. Catching scripts is the wrong way, try to capture a REAL chocolate instead, no matter if it''s a bad composition or so, you would get comments to improve your skills if they see you take the effort. (1 - but I hope to see good photos from you)</td>', 'Sorry to say that, but this isn''t really the type of photo I expected for the challenge. Catching scripts is the wrong way, try to capture a REAL chocolate instead, no matter if it''s a bad composition or so, you would get comments to improve your skills if they see you take the effort. (1 - but I hope to see good photos from you)', '2004-07-26 12:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(826014, 92585, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have left just a few mms more space on the top, and somehow I would have skipped the dark corner on the bottom left. Otherwise a great photo! Lighting is spot on, colours and sharpness are great, I would really like to taste it! :-) (9)</td>', 'I would have left just a few mms more space on the top, and somehow I would have skipped the dark corner on the bottom left. Otherwise a great photo! Lighting is spot on, colours and sharpness are great, I would really like to taste it! :-) (9)', '2004-07-26 12:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(826017, 92518, 11295, '<td valign="top">Cute. :)</td>', 'Cute. :)', '2004-07-26 12:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(826021, 92671, 11295, '<td valign="top">Original idea! I like this one a lot... you''ve shown it well, too. Congrats.</td>', 'Original idea! I like this one a lot... you''ve shown it well, too. Congrats.', '2004-07-26 12:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(826023, 92616, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think less would have been better here. The standing glass and the flat plate somehow breaks the balance here, the glass is also tilting to the right. I would have captured a smaller part of the plate, rather cut from the plate, it would have been more effective. The background is untidy, and lighting could be improved, too. Use diffused lights from more directions, and at least you could have ironed the table-cover before the shot. Keep trying, the stuff on the plate looks good. :-) (3)</td>', 'I think less would have been better here. The standing glass and the flat plate somehow breaks the balance here, the glass is also tilting to the right. I would have captured a smaller part of the plate, rather cut from the plate, it would have been more effective. The background is untidy, and lighting could be improved, too. Use diffused lights from more directions, and at least you could have ironed the table-cover before the shot. Keep trying, the stuff on the plate looks good. :-) (3)', '2004-07-26 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(826024, 91881, 10858, '<td valign="top">Unique idea, composition works very well! :-) I like the additional meaning of the photo, and the fill-the-frame effect. IMHO, it could be a bit sharper, seems like a bit OOF (out of focus), it distracts me and looks strange. (5)</td>', 'Unique idea, composition works very well! :-) I like the additional meaning of the photo, and the fill-the-frame effect. IMHO, it could be a bit sharper, seems like a bit OOF (out of focus), it distracts me and looks strange. (5)', '2004-07-26 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(826027, 92659, 10858, '<td valign="top">Good idea and crop. Though I feel problems with WB, the chocolate seems to be too brick-red for me and lighting is too harsch. For an erotic effect, use more diffused and mystical lighting, to avoid blow outs and strong shadows. I feel your border a bit rivalising with the main subject, choose a less wild colour for the inside thin line. Keep trying. :-) (3)</td>', 'Good idea and crop. Though I feel problems with WB, the chocolate seems to be too brick-red for me and lighting is too harsch. For an erotic effect, use more diffused and mystical lighting, to avoid blow outs and strong shadows. I feel your border a bit rivalising with the main subject, choose a less wild colour for the inside thin line. Keep trying. :-) (3)', '2004-07-26 12:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(826030, 92580, 10858, '<td valign="top">Great diagonal composition, I also like the brown shades. Filling the frame was a good idea, maybe lighting could have come from a lower angle but I am not sure. Simple, and good shot, maybe I still mi ssomething, but the problem must be with me. (8)</td>', 'Great diagonal composition, I also like the brown shades. Filling the frame was a good idea, maybe lighting could have come from a lower angle but I am not sure. Simple, and good shot, maybe I still mi ssomething, but the problem must be with me. (8)', '2004-07-26 12:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(826034, 92579, 10858, '<td valign="top">Uhh... I think WB is definitely wrong here, the chocolate has bluey shades. Lighting is too harsch, the reflection of the flash is too strong on the handle, and there are blow outs and aberration on the white sweets. The background isn''t impressive either. The angle you chose is good, but there are still a lot to improve. Use diffused lights and set up WB for indoor bulb. Avoid using too dark and too light elements on the photo if you are not sure about light metering with great contast. I was hesitating about 2, but for the composition I give you the higher value. (3)</td>', 'Uhh... I think WB is definitely wrong here, the chocolate has bluey shades. Lighting is too harsch, the reflection of the flash is too strong on the handle, and there are blow outs and aberration on the white sweets. The background isn''t impressive either. The angle you chose is good, but there are still a lot to improve. Use diffused lights and set up WB for indoor bulb. Avoid using too dark and too light elements on the photo if you are not sure about light metering with great contast. I was hesitating about 2, but for the composition I give you the higher value. (3)', '2004-07-26 12:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(826038, 91627, 10858, '<td valign="top">DOF is excellent! :-) Personally I would have placed the eplty slid a bit more lower, for example cutting the sweet on the bottom off. For me, that composition seems a bit more balanced, it''s just an idea. (7)</td>', 'DOF is excellent! :-) Personally I would have placed the eplty slid a bit more lower, for example cutting the sweet on the bottom off. For me, that composition seems a bit more balanced, it''s just an idea. (7)', '2004-07-26 12:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(826040, 92063, 10858, '<td valign="top">There are too many things on this shot, and I can''t find a system in the composition. Why the cognac? Why the coffee? Why did you crop off from the chocolate? I Think a few bars of chocolate and one little flower would have done better. This way your photo is too busy and I don''t find the main subject. Colours are great and I also like your background. (4)</td>', 'There are too many things on this shot, and I can''t find a system in the composition. Why the cognac? Why the coffee? Why did you crop off from the chocolate? I Think a few bars of chocolate and one little flower would have done better. This way your photo is too busy and I don''t find the main subject. Colours are great and I also like your background. (4)', '2004-07-26 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(826044, 92450, 10858, '<td valign="top">This is an effective one, I like it a much. The splash into the chocolate is amazing!!! :-) I would have applied a different crop, this way the plate''s edges are too close to the frame. I would use a tighter crop around the splash, I think it''s worth to get rid of the plate, it doesn''t add too much. Centered compositions work better with tighter crops, I think so. :-) (7 - because I still love the splas and it must have been difficult to take the shot)</td>', 'This is an effective one, I like it a much. The splash into the chocolate is amazing!!! :-) I would have applied a different crop, this way the plate''s edges are too close to the frame. I would use a tighter crop around the splash, I think it''s worth to get rid of the plate, it doesn''t add too much. Centered compositions work better with tighter crops, I think so. :-) (7 - because I still love the splas and it must have been difficult to take the shot)', '2004-07-26 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(826047, 92051, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but lighting needs improvement. It''s good on the wrapping, but the edge of the box with the Chocolate text is too dark. I also think WB was improper here, colours look quite unnatural. I like the graduate colours of your background. (3)</td>', 'Nice composition, but lighting needs improvement. It''s good on the wrapping, but the edge of the box with the Chocolate text is too dark. I also think WB was improper here, colours look quite unnatural. I like the graduate colours of your background. (3)', '2004-07-26 13:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(826048, 92148, 23055, '<td valign="top">sweet!</td>', 'sweet!', '2004-07-26 13:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(826052, 92542, 23055, '<td valign="top">Very chocolately! Personal fav. this week.</td>', 'Very chocolately! Personal fav. this week.', '2004-07-26 13:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(826054, 91372, 23055, '<td valign="top">Big points for making me laugh out loud.</td>', 'Big points for making me laugh out loud.', '2004-07-26 13:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(826055, 92015, 23055, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo!</td>', 'Really nice photo!', '2004-07-26 13:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(826057, 91580, 10858, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of capturing the wrapping, rather the chocolate inside. The idea of making a rainbow is great. :-) In this case I would have pahed more attention on showing exactly the same amount of the box on each part, and lighting is strange on the right, seems like the wrapping was bended and lighting made some shadows. (4)</td>', 'I am not a fan of capturing the wrapping, rather the chocolate inside. The idea of making a rainbow is great. :-) In this case I would have pahed more attention on showing exactly the same amount of the box on each part, and lighting is strange on the right, seems like the wrapping was bended and lighting made some shadows. (4)', '2004-07-26 13:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(826059, 92537, 23055, '<td valign="top">This has a real nice look to it. Would have scored high, I think, for the "advertising" competition as well. It would look good in a magazine!</td>', 'This has a real nice look to it. Would have scored high, I think, for the "advertising" competition as well. It would look good in a magazine!', '2004-07-26 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(826066, 92690, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and creative. :-) I also like the reflection on the chocolate. I would add more contrast and a bigger split of chocolate, to gain more reflection and fill the photo a bit more. (6)</td>', 'Nice idea, and creative. :-) I also like the reflection on the chocolate. I would add more contrast and a bigger split of chocolate, to gain more reflection and fill the photo a bit more. (6)', '2004-07-26 13:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(826069, 91582, 10858, '<td valign="top">Well... I don''t think I would eat any chocolate if it was the first photo I saw about it in my life. Composition is too busy and untidy, lighting is too harsch, I don''t get it, really sorry... (2)</td>', 'Well... I don''t think I would eat any chocolate if it was the first photo I saw about it in my life. Composition is too busy and untidy, lighting is too harsch, I don''t get it, really sorry... (2)', '2004-07-26 13:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(826072, 92578, 6008, '<td valign="top">The squirls are very artistic, the composition isnt bad, the lighting is ok although some of the light reflection spots are a little distracting. The idea is a good one.</td>', 'The squirls are very artistic, the composition isnt bad, the lighting is ok although some of the light reflection spots are a little distracting. The idea is a good one.', '2004-07-26 13:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(826073, 92608, 10858, '<td valign="top">Unnatural, indeed, but sooooo CREATIVE! :-) I love the vivid colours with the pastel plate, lighting is fine, wonderful sharp... definitely ribbon winner! I keep my fingers crossed for you! (10)</td>', 'Unnatural, indeed, but sooooo CREATIVE! :-) I love the vivid colours with the pastel plate, lighting is fine, wonderful sharp... definitely ribbon winner! I keep my fingers crossed for you! (10)', '2004-07-26 13:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(826076, 92058, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think a different andgle (taking the shot from higher) would work better. The idea is cool, but there''s too much space on the bottom and the subjects are very much OOF (out of focus). Sorry... (2)</td>', 'I think a different andgle (taking the shot from higher) would work better. The idea is cool, but there''s too much space on the bottom and the subjects are very much OOF (out of focus). Sorry... (2)', '2004-07-26 13:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(826077, 92642, 23312, '<td valign="top">I love this photo - wonderful sense of motion/spinning.</td>', 'I love this photo - wonderful sense of motion/spinning.', '2004-07-26 13:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(826079, 92553, 23312, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very well executed!</td>', 'Great idea, very well executed!', '2004-07-26 13:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(826082, 91961, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. :-) It could be a bit sharper, I think so. The environment looks a bit too unnatural for a tasty chocolate composition, too and the angle you choose is not very interesting. I would have lowered the camera for it a bit. Alltogether it''s nice. (5)</td>', 'Nice idea. :-) It could be a bit sharper, I think so. The environment looks a bit too unnatural for a tasty chocolate composition, too and the angle you choose is not very interesting. I would have lowered the camera for it a bit. Alltogether it''s nice. (5)', '2004-07-26 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(826083, 92276, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the stream of liquid chocolate and the lighting that catches both sides of it. I also like the composition of it too. I''m not so fond of the chocolate bar at the bottom although it is well lit, but I cant explain why. Even so, it''s a good image.</td>', 'I like the stream of liquid chocolate and the lighting that catches both sides of it. I also like the composition of it too. I''m not so fond of the chocolate bar at the bottom although it is well lit, but I cant explain why. Even so, it''s a good image.', '2004-07-26 13:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(826086, 92671, 23312, '<td valign="top">This is in my top 5 - I really like the concept and the execution.  The shadow on the 2nd piece of chocolate, for some reason, bugs me.</td>', 'This is in my top 5 - I really like the concept and the execution.  The shadow on the 2nd piece of chocolate, for some reason, bugs me.', '2004-07-26 13:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(826091, 92656, 23312, '<td valign="top">Amazing coincicence - I saw Cadyshack the day after I saw this picture.  It was funny then, it''s funny now - good job!</td>', 'Amazing coincicence - I saw Cadyshack the day after I saw this picture.  It was funny then, it''s funny now - good job!', '2004-07-26 13:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(826094, 92560, 10858, '<td valign="top">Simple and great, though, looks like cards. Maybe a bit more wow factor is what I miss here. I like the colours and the lighting, smart one. :-) (8)</td>', 'Simple and great, though, looks like cards. Maybe a bit more wow factor is what I miss here. I like the colours and the lighting, smart one. :-) (8)', '2004-07-26 13:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(826095, 91917, 6008, '<td valign="top">I actually like this despite seeing a few technical issues that arent the best. The main issue is the backdrop used, you can see the crumples and texture in the cloth, although part of me wonders if that was intentional. I like the green, it adds a nice dash of color to the composition. Everything seems in focus, the lighting looks natural, which gives it a kind of fresh feel. It''s appealing.</td>', 'I actually like this despite seeing a few technical issues that arent the best. The main issue is the backdrop used, you can see the crumples and texture in the cloth, although part of me wonders if that was intentional. I like the green, it adds a nice dash of color to the composition. Everything seems in focus, the lighting looks natural, which gives it a kind of fresh feel. It''s appealing.', '2004-07-26 13:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(826101, 92663, 10858, '<td valign="top">What''s this and what does this have to do with chocolate? (1 - for not meeting the challenge)</td>', 'What''s this and what does this have to do with chocolate? (1 - for not meeting the challenge)', '2004-07-26 13:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(826105, 92689, 10858, '<td valign="top">:o)</td>', ':o)', '2004-07-26 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(826121, 91830, 10858, '<td valign="top">The mint in the front could be sharper, it''s a bit out of focus on the edge. Nice couple of chocolate, though, there is nothing special. I mean the composition or lighting could have more wow factor. (4)</td>', 'The mint in the front could be sharper, it''s a bit out of focus on the edge. Nice couple of chocolate, though, there is nothing special. I mean the composition or lighting could have more wow factor. (4)', '2004-07-26 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(826143, 91977, 10858, '<td valign="top">The photo  is nice, but the association is too complicated. Okay, we need milk for Chocolate and the sign of Milka is a cow, but I''d rather use real chocolate for the challenge. For me it seems like you have submitted something, not taking the shot precisely for the challenge.For me, this doesn''t fit it well. Sorry if I am mistaken. The cows are anyway sweet and colours are great, except a few shadows and blow outs on the animals. (3)</td>', 'The photo  is nice, but the association is too complicated. Okay, we need milk for Chocolate and the sign of Milka is a cow, but I''d rather use real chocolate for the challenge. For me it seems like you have submitted something, not taking the shot precisely for the challenge.For me, this doesn''t fit it well. Sorry if I am mistaken. The cows are anyway sweet and colours are great, except a few shadows and blow outs on the animals. (3)', '2004-07-26 13:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(826190, 92391, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think the composition would be better without the gold bar of chocolate. The background is a bit tilting to the left (the edge of the table), and there are too many thinkgs on this photo. Fewer would be more effective, like the syroup, the cakes, without the glass and the bar on the bottom, or something like that. (4)</td>', 'I think the composition would be better without the gold bar of chocolate. The background is a bit tilting to the left (the edge of the table), and there are too many thinkgs on this photo. Fewer would be more effective, like the syroup, the cakes, without the glass and the bar on the bottom, or something like that. (4)', '2004-07-26 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(826197, 92400, 10858, '<td valign="top">Is this a high key shot? I love the composition, the crop, the lighting a much! Few, but effective colours, I love this. :-) I also love the grape leaves, they add a nice colour and shape element to the composition. 10 from me, and good luck! (10)</td>', 'Is this a high key shot? I love the composition, the crop, the lighting a much! Few, but effective colours, I love this. :-) I also love the grape leaves, they add a nice colour and shape element to the composition. 10 from me, and good luck! (10)', '2004-07-26 14:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
