(827099, 92524, 6771, '<td valign="top">One of my top two.  Alot of the shots seem to have the WB off one way or another, but this one is on.  Love the DOF and focus that draws your eyes to the middle and then back frther into the pic.  A few "hot spots" noted, but maybe diffusing the light just a touch more.  Still excellent!!</td>', 'One of my top two.  Alot of the shots seem to have the WB off one way or another, but this one is on.  Love the DOF and focus that draws your eyes to the middle and then back frther into the pic.  A few "hot spots" noted, but maybe diffusing the light just a touch more.  Still excellent!!', '2004-07-27 03:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(827100, 91633, 6771, '<td valign="top">One of my top 2.  Love the luscious, silky sheen of the reds.  They just highlight the chocolate a bit more.  Great shadows on the bottom sides to make it melt into the background.</td>', 'One of my top 2.  Love the luscious, silky sheen of the reds.  They just highlight the chocolate a bit more.  Great shadows on the bottom sides to make it melt into the background.', '2004-07-27 03:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(827101, 92663, 6771, '<td valign="top">As hard as I am looking at this.  I can''t make out what it is or means.  looks like 4 lightbulbs in a fixture with one on, and they are spinning around.</td>', 'As hard as I am looking at this.  I can''t make out what it is or means.  looks like 4 lightbulbs in a fixture with one on, and they are spinning around.', '2004-07-27 03:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(827103, 92380, 6771, '<td valign="top">Ummmmm...besides very boring, it is OOF, the WB balance needs to be adjusted, it appears a very muddy coloring to it.  The composition is somewhat lacking.  For this a suggestion...back away from it some and try another angle...and some chocolate.  (C:<br/></td>', 'Ummmmm...besides very boring, it is OOF, the WB balance needs to be adjusted, it appears a very muddy coloring to it.  The composition is somewhat lacking.  For this a suggestion...back away from it some and try another angle...and some chocolate.  (C:', '2004-07-27 03:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(827104, 92576, 20029, '<td valign="top">Great picture and EXCELLENT idea! Hope it does well.</td>', 'Great picture and EXCELLENT idea! Hope it does well.', '2004-07-27 03:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(827105, 92684, 20029, '<td valign="top">Very cute! I would have never thought of that! Very well set up and I can tell that you spent a lot of time on it. cool boat. 10</td>', 'Very cute! I would have never thought of that! Very well set up and I can tell that you spent a lot of time on it. cool boat. 10', '2004-07-27 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(827106, 92681, 6771, '<td valign="top">As hard as I am trying, I am not seeing the chocolate very well.  I can see a brown hand and what looks like chocolate or oil all over the middle area.  This would very well been helped with having the WB adjusted.  It is TOO warm in the color spectrum.  The focus seems off also.  Some more diffuse lighting seems to be needed to illuminate the whole picture better.</td>', 'As hard as I am trying, I am not seeing the chocolate very well.  I can see a brown hand and what looks like chocolate or oil all over the middle area.  This would very well been helped with having the WB adjusted.  It is TOO warm in the color spectrum.  The focus seems off also.  Some more diffuse lighting seems to be needed to illuminate the whole picture better.', '2004-07-27 03:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(827107, 92678, 20029, '<td valign="top">this is one of my ribbon pictures! well done. and its in perfect focus! 10</td>', 'this is one of my ribbon pictures! well done. and its in perfect focus! 10', '2004-07-27 03:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(827108, 92534, 6771, '<td valign="top">As much as this is a good idea, the focus is off.  Nothing is really in focus.  The choice I believe would have been the bite marks of the chocolate.  Heard it already, I imagine,You can turn off the date stamp.</td>', 'As much as this is a good idea, the focus is off.  Nothing is really in focus.  The choice I believe would have been the bite marks of the chocolate.  Heard it already, I imagine,You can turn off the date stamp.', '2004-07-27 03:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(827109, 92058, 6771, '<td valign="top">Having a hard time getting the sense of where the focus is to be.  It looks the sharpest on the bricks, but I think a bit more DOF would bring it all into view, since there are so many things that are competing for my eyes attention.  Diffusing the light off to the left may help get rid of the harshness to it also.</td>', 'Having a hard time getting the sense of where the focus is to be.  It looks the sharpest on the bricks, but I think a bit more DOF would bring it all into view, since there are so many things that are competing for my eyes attention.  Diffusing the light off to the left may help get rid of the harshness to it also.', '2004-07-27 03:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(827111, 92613, 6771, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, and very familiar.  Not a lot of interest though.  the light and focus she be up towards the baby''s face some more.</td>', 'Cute kid, and very familiar.  Not a lot of interest though.  the light and focus she be up towards the baby''s face some more.', '2004-07-27 03:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(827112, 92689, 6771, '<td valign="top">Brought a grin, but boring.  Very dark chocloate there</td>', 'Brought a grin, but boring.  Very dark chocloate there', '2004-07-27 03:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(827113, 91278, 24599, '<td valign="top">nice dof</td>', 'nice dof', '2004-07-27 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(827114, 92626, 6771, '<td valign="top">Hard to view the pic at this size.  COuld be OOF focus.  The light from the back is a touch harsh, a difuser of some sort could help</td>', 'Hard to view the pic at this size.  COuld be OOF focus.  The light from the back is a touch harsh, a difuser of some sort could help', '2004-07-27 03:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(827115, 92667, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Lots and lots of artifact and noise.  The light on the right one is very harsh and distracts the eye.  We now have your fingerprints on record (the middle one).  (C:</td>', 'Nice idea.  Lots and lots of artifact and noise.  The light on the right one is very harsh and distracts the eye.  We now have your fingerprints on record (the middle one).  (C:', '2004-07-27 03:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(827116, 92645, 6771, '<td valign="top">this one is a great idea and looks like it took some time, but...the size kills it.  Hard to make a proper judgement of it at this distance</td>', 'this one is a great idea and looks like it took some time, but...the size kills it.  Hard to make a proper judgement of it at this distance', '2004-07-27 03:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(827117, 92399, 6771, '<td valign="top">What appears to be a very nice shot, but suffers from being way too small.  Unable to properly judge this</td>', 'What appears to be a very nice shot, but suffers from being way too small.  Unable to properly judge this', '2004-07-27 03:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(827118, 92644, 6771, '<td valign="top">The flash is too bright on the paper and then falls off on the ends.  Leaves ugly shadows behind also.  Seems a touch OOF where I expect it to be on the left side.</td>', 'The flash is too bright on the paper and then falls off on the ends.  Leaves ugly shadows behind also.  Seems a touch OOF where I expect it to be on the left side.', '2004-07-27 03:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(827119, 92261, 6771, '<td valign="top">Ummmm....K.  How about, alot of hot spots from the flash.</td>', 'Ummmm....K.  How about, alot of hot spots from the flash.', '2004-07-27 03:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(827120, 92691, 6771, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had soke decent lighting set up.  Trying to get rid of shadows totally would seem to look better.  this one suffers mostly from being OOF, way OOF.</td>', 'Looks like you had soke decent lighting set up.  Trying to get rid of shadows totally would seem to look better.  this one suffers mostly from being OOF, way OOF.', '2004-07-27 03:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(827121, 91804, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, but it looks like you got some camera shake on the left side (?).  It actually appears that the DOF needs to be deeper, since some things on the right are more in focus than the rest, and with a straight on shot, i would expect to see it all in focus.</td>', 'Nice set up, but it looks like you got some camera shake on the left side (?).  It actually appears that the DOF needs to be deeper, since some things on the right are more in focus than the rest, and with a straight on shot, i would expect to see it all in focus.', '2004-07-27 03:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(827122, 92382, 6771, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...I love the composition of this, but the noise/grain is bothersome and really detracts from it.</td>', 'Hmmm...I love the composition of this, but the noise/grain is bothersome and really detracts from it.', '2004-07-27 03:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(827123, 92203, 6771, '<td valign="top">The focus is a touch off.  Eyes are usually what you want to focus on with people, but the chocolate should be the subject for this.  not too interesting.</td>', 'The focus is a touch off.  Eyes are usually what you want to focus on with people, but the chocolate should be the subject for this.  not too interesting.', '2004-07-27 03:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(827124, 92523, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, but way OOF and lots of color noise noted in the bottom half of this.</td>', 'Great perspective, but way OOF and lots of color noise noted in the bottom half of this.', '2004-07-27 03:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(827126, 92657, 6771, '<td valign="top">An otherwise interesting perspective, without a really sharp area of focus</td>', 'An otherwise interesting perspective, without a really sharp area of focus', '2004-07-27 03:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(827128, 92243, 6771, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  When I first saw it I thought it would suit something more towards Viagra...but then that is where the depression could come from.  the light is too harsh on the right, and I think that the focus could be just a touch sharper on that poor guy on the right.  It seems that is just a touch behind the area of interest.  Not totally sure but I feel the WB could be adjusted a little too, seems a bit muddy, throughout.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  When I first saw it I thought it would suit something more towards Viagra...but then that is where the depression could come from.  the light is too harsh on the right, and I think that the focus could be just a touch sharper on that poor guy on the right.  It seems that is just a touch behind the area of interest.  Not totally sure but I feel the WB could be adjusted a little too, seems a bit muddy, throughout.', '2004-07-27 03:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(827129, 92391, 6771, '<td valign="top">Alot of subjects here that are asking for the attention and focus.  the focus seems to only be sharp around the cake and pie, which leave the others stranded.  My eye expects to look at the others and see them clearly.  WB too warm.</td>', 'Alot of subjects here that are asking for the attention and focus.  the focus seems to only be sharp around the cake and pie, which leave the others stranded.  My eye expects to look at the others and see them clearly.  WB too warm.', '2004-07-27 03:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(827132, 92670, 6771, '<td valign="top">An interesting set up which might have worked better in a different composition.  Seems to front on.  Don''t be afraid to move the camera around and try a what seems weird angle, may produce great results.  Touch OOF.  the Y is great but then it gets soft on the e and a little sharper again on the s.</td>', 'An interesting set up which might have worked better in a different composition.  Seems to front on.  Don''t be afraid to move the camera around and try a what seems weird angle, may produce great results.  Touch OOF.  the Y is great but then it gets soft on the e and a little sharper again on the s.', '2004-07-27 03:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(827134, 92612, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but pretty bland.  Different compostion/angle?  Not really anything in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice idea, but pretty bland.  Different compostion/angle?  Not really anything in sharp focus.', '2004-07-27 03:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(827135, 92534, 21158, '<td valign="top">slightly out of focus</td>', 'slightly out of focus', '2004-07-27 03:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(827145, 92553, 24268, '<td valign="top">beatutiful lighting and pattern display. The colour scheme seams a bit to dark in places, warm in others.</td>', 'beatutiful lighting and pattern display. The colour scheme seams a bit to dark in places, warm in others.', '2004-07-27 04:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(827146, 92354, 24268, '<td valign="top">gloriously done. My only criticism is that the transparency further back of the brown liquid, while accent the drip, destracts the eye.</td>', 'gloriously done. My only criticism is that the transparency further back of the brown liquid, while accent the drip, destracts the eye.', '2004-07-27 04:05:46.000000', NULL, 1);
