(827410, 92578, 22976, '<td valign="top">I really like the the way the chocolate compliments the color of the skin.  The only suggestion I would meke would be to have one breast much less obvious than the other, and then to have the chocolate swirl start at the obivous one and then to go the the less obvious one.  And then have one of her fingers dipped in chocolate tracing along her belly.  That way the obsever looks at the obvious breast, then follows the swirlt to the next and then to the finger and back to the first breast.  Better yet, leave the photo alone, this is yours, not mine.  Now I just have to find a model and some chocolate syrup.  ;)</td>', 'I really like the the way the chocolate compliments the color of the skin.  The only suggestion I would meke would be to have one breast much less obvious than the other, and then to have the chocolate swirl start at the obivous one and then to go the the less obvious one.  And then have one of her fingers dipped in chocolate tracing along her belly.  That way the obsever looks at the obvious breast, then follows the swirlt to the next and then to the finger and back to the first breast.  Better yet, leave the photo alone, this is yours, not mine.  Now I just have to find a model and some chocolate syrup.  ;)', '2004-07-27 10:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
