(828519, 92609, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, although it''s funny that Cadbury is actually distributed by Hersey in the US. Also a powerman 5000 song so that''s always a plus! Anyways.... You did a good job of getting the white background, the depth of field is good as everything seems to be in focus, the composition is chaotic but goes with the concept you were trying to convey. Not a bad shot.</td>', 'Interesting idea, although it''s funny that Cadbury is actually distributed by Hersey in the US. Also a powerman 5000 song so that''s always a plus! Anyways.... You did a good job of getting the white background, the depth of field is good as everything seems to be in focus, the composition is chaotic but goes with the concept you were trying to convey. Not a bad shot.', '2004-07-27 23:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(828521, 92240, 24239, '<td valign="top">very appetizing</td>', 'very appetizing', '2004-07-27 23:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(828524, 92576, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good idea and it must have taken you ages to set up! Unfortunately the technical side isnt quite there as there is significant noise and the quality isnt that great. The uncovered area on the top right is a little distracting too. But I love the idea!</td>', 'Good idea and it must have taken you ages to set up! Unfortunately the technical side isnt quite there as there is significant noise and the quality isnt that great. The uncovered area on the top right is a little distracting too. But I love the idea!', '2004-07-27 23:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
