(828526, 92682, 24511, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a spinning top lying on its back mainly due to the colourful circular forms in the background.  Bravo for the splendid close-up.</td>', 'This reminds me of a spinning top lying on its back mainly due to the colourful circular forms in the background.  Bravo for the splendid close-up.', '2004-07-27 23:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
