(828532, 92576, 7485, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but the color fringing really hurts the image. White chocolate with a blue aura just isn''t appetizing!</td>', 'Neat idea, but the color fringing really hurts the image. White chocolate with a blue aura just isn''t appetizing!', '2004-07-27 23:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(828533, 92558, 6008, '<td valign="top">Cute wizard of oz reference in the title, I like the spotlight lighting effect, and the whole idea is kinda neat too. There is a little noise in the image and the top part of the chocolate is a little out of focus. Having the light a little more forward so the writing part isnt as dark and trying to get an even lighting over the chocolate may have been good too.</td>', 'Cute wizard of oz reference in the title, I like the spotlight lighting effect, and the whole idea is kinda neat too. There is a little noise in the image and the top part of the chocolate is a little out of focus. Having the light a little more forward so the writing part isnt as dark and trying to get an even lighting over the chocolate may have been good too.', '2004-07-28 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(828534, 92066, 23765, '<td valign="top">a little over exposed. very harsh details. these hershy''s were in the fridge for long time</td>', 'a little over exposed. very harsh details. these hershy''s were in the fridge for long time', '2004-07-28 00:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(828539, 92580, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, focus, and composition. Nice mix of textures too. It meets the challenge well, and I could also see it as part of an advertisement but it lacks the ''wow'' for DPC.</td>', 'Good lighting, focus, and composition. Nice mix of textures too. It meets the challenge well, and I could also see it as part of an advertisement but it lacks the ''wow'' for DPC.', '2004-07-28 00:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
