(828541, 92129, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Did you try one with the chocolate facing the other way, her holding it with her teeth? I''m guessing that might work even better.</td>', 'Great idea! Did you try one with the chocolate facing the other way, her holding it with her teeth? I''m guessing that might work even better.', '2004-07-28 00:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
