(828609, 92287, 6771, '<td valign="top">I do like the DOF on this and the focus.  The colors look drab though.  The brown standing out against a vivid white backgound would emphasize it more.  Curves to adjust it some, maybe?</td>', 'I do like the DOF on this and the focus.  The colors look drab though.  The brown standing out against a vivid white backgound would emphasize it more.  Curves to adjust it some, maybe?', '2004-07-28 00:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
