(828618, 92583, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  the lighting is too bright in the left upper corner and then drops off.  The middle over seems to have the optimal lighting.  Diffusing it from above (since it looks like a straight on shot) may have been the answer?</td>', 'Very creative!  the lighting is too bright in the left upper corner and then drops off.  The middle over seems to have the optimal lighting.  Diffusing it from above (since it looks like a straight on shot) may have been the answer?', '2004-07-28 00:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
