(829261, 92578, 4871, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the great feedback - it was very frustrating trying to get the lighting right for this without the right equipment. I know the harsh highlights is what bought the score down. I tried using my little video studio light, flash and a 60 watt globe as a fill light, but in the end just used the 60 watt globe! Plus the dilema with the chocolate - I now know the difference between eating chocolate and cooking chocolate!! Eating chocolate doesn''t melt!!<br/> <br/>By the way the model happens to be my beautiful wife who was more than happy to pose for this shot. For those who wanted to know, unfortunately by the end (it was 1:30am) we were both so tired she just jumped in the shower and I packed up. Bit of a rip I know! :P<br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone for the great feedback - it was very frustrating trying to get the lighting right for this without the right equipment. I know the harsh highlights is what bought the score down. I tried using my little video studio light, flash and a 60 watt globe as a fill light, but in the end just used the 60 watt globe! Plus the dilema with the chocolate - I now know the difference between eating chocolate and cooking chocolate!! Eating chocolate doesn''t melt!! By the way the model happens to be my beautiful wife who was more than happy to pose for this shot. For those who wanted to know, unfortunately by the end (it was 1:30am) we were both so tired she just jumped in the shower and I packed up. Bit of a rip I know! :P', '2004-07-28 07:12:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(829264, 92517, 22720, '<td valign="top">:-) our diamonds places together</td>', ':-) our diamonds places together', '2004-07-28 07:19:11.000000', NULL, 0),
