(829282, 91993, 12825, '<td valign="top">Looks like I got hit for not meeting the challenge criteria -- not unexpected -- this entry was more for fun than anything.<br/> <br/>Someone mentioned the water droplets -- Lara is wearing a wetsuit, so I thought it appropriate.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all for the comments -- any challenge where my shot gets added as a favourite counts as a good one for me! =)</td>', 'Looks like I got hit for not meeting the challenge criteria -- not unexpected -- this entry was more for fun than anything. Someone mentioned the water droplets -- Lara is wearing a wetsuit, so I thought it appropriate. Thanks to all for the comments -- any challenge where my shot gets added as a favourite counts as a good one for me! =)', '2004-07-28 07:56:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(829311, 92577, 18349, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your votes and comments, kind peeps of DPC land...this was actually a fairly last-minute stab at the challenge...five white chocolate truffles, hershey''s syrup, positioned carefully on a (get this) E-Z Bake Oven pan...(I know...I know), all on top of my old Sony camera''s box with a piece of white fabric draped over it and a piece of foam core for the BG.  Lit with two desk lamps.  When I first processed the picture in PS, it was kind of yellow, so I desaturated all the yellows, and this is what I got.  Who knew??   LOL  ;o)</td>', 'Thanks for your votes and comments, kind peeps of DPC land...this was actually a fairly last-minute stab at the challenge...five white chocolate truffles, hershey''s syrup, positioned carefully on a (get this) E-Z Bake Oven pan...(I know...I know), all on top of my old Sony camera''s box with a piece of white fabric draped over it and a piece of foam core for the BG.  Lit with two desk lamps.  When I first processed the picture in PS, it was kind of yellow, so I desaturated all the yellows, and this is what I got.  Who knew??   LOL  ;o)', '2004-07-28 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(829331, 92578, 472, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  and very enticing ...</td>', 'AWESOME!  and very enticing ...', '2004-07-28 08:25:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(829335, 92644, 10268, '<td valign="top">Man, I hate the way people vote here.<br/> <br/>You have a photo that completely fits the topic since it has chocolate, had nice composition and focus, and get''s a 3.4 average.  No one should rate this any less than a 4.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I think this picture deserves much, much higher.</td>', 'Man, I hate the way people vote here. You have a photo that completely fits the topic since it has chocolate, had nice composition and focus, and get''s a 3.4 average.  No one should rate this any less than a 4. Anyway, I think this picture deserves much, much higher.', '2004-07-28 08:28:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(829339, 92450, 16256, '<td valign="top">Hello to all,  <br/> <br/>Before everything he/she would like to ask excuses for not answering individually. It is that I don''t speak English, my language homeland is the Portuguese. What reads and I write here is with an electronic translator''s help.  <br/> <br/>I am very happy, honest and grateful to all that had contributed so that it won the 1st place of this challenge.  <br/> <br/>As I already explained above, this picture was made with the aid of a "flash trigger" that I learned to do through the internet. For who doesn''t know, it is a circuit with microphone, linked to the flash and that it captures the sound of the drop when falling. Of course besides, I made an elaboration with the elements and illumination, in a careful way, with hope of obtaining a good voting, but it didn''t imagine to be the first. Thank you very much to all, I will keep that moment for the rest of my life.</td>', 'Hello to all,   Before everything he/she would like to ask excuses for not answering individually. It is that I don''t speak English, my language homeland is the Portuguese. What reads and I write here is with an electronic translator''s help.   I am very happy, honest and grateful to all that had contributed so that it won the 1st place of this challenge.   As I already explained above, this picture was made with the aid of a "flash trigger" that I learned to do through the internet. For who doesn''t know, it is a circuit with microphone, linked to the flash and that it captures the sound of the drop when falling. Of course besides, I made an elaboration with the elements and illumination, in a careful way, with hope of obtaining a good voting, but it didn''t imagine to be the first. Thank you very much to all, I will keep that moment for the rest of my life.', '2004-07-28 08:31:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(829380, 91771, 13365, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted, Im really excited about my first ribbon! Now that I got the taste I want more!! :)  There were actually things about this shot which still bother me but oh well, i was bound to the basic editing rules. I have an outtake which I will probably post up<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-28 07:56:51.</i></td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted, Im really excited about my first ribbon! Now that I got the taste I want more!! :)  There were actually things about this shot which still bother me but oh well, i was bound to the basic editing rules. I have an outtake which I will probably post up', '2004-07-28 08:53:03.000000', '2004-07-28 08:56:51.000000', 0),
