(829791, 92261, 24421, '<td valign="top">"Everyone''s a winner" except for this one.  I got the play on words too, but many wouldn''t.  Maybe a mug and a hot chocolate packet might have given some an extra hint.  If not, at least those who said it didn''t meet the challenge would have had something to vote on.</td>', '"Everyone''s a winner" except for this one.  I got the play on words too, but many wouldn''t.  Maybe a mug and a hot chocolate packet might have given some an extra hint.  If not, at least those who said it didn''t meet the challenge would have had something to vote on.', '2004-07-28 12:00:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(829806, 92642, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings....<br/> <br/>I didn''t get to comment during the challenge, but this was my favorite photo in the chocolate competition.  Excellent work :)</td>', 'Greetings.... I didn''t get to comment during the challenge, but this was my favorite photo in the chocolate competition.  Excellent work :)', '2004-07-28 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(830013, 92518, 18868, '<td valign="top">Hello ikat -- you asked how I thought of the "crime scene" image.  It was sort of a domino effect... unfortunately, I have only a small bit of time I can dedicate to DPC because my job is too demanding.  So, I had a bag of m&amp;ms on my desk at work, and I was shooting. <br/> <br/>A guy who is a real jerk came by and made a rude comment about "playing" on work time.  For the record, I was at lunch.  :)  Anyway, a few passive agressive gestures at his departing back, and I angrily grabbed one of the subjects and chomped down on it.  This triggered the thought of how our civilized psyche copes with stresses that, if we were totally primal, would be expressed in violence.  The photo is essentially a visualization of the act of transferrence, with chocolate as the actors in the play.  Yeah, too many psychology courses in college... <br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone that voted, and a special thanks to those that added the photo to their favorites: that''s a real compliment!  This has been my personal best so far!  Whoo hoo!</td>', 'Hello ikat -- you asked how I thought of the "crime scene" image.  It was sort of a domino effect... unfortunately, I have only a small bit of time I can dedicate to DPC because my job is too demanding.  So, I had a bag of m&ms on my desk at work, and I was shooting.  A guy who is a real jerk came by and made a rude comment about "playing" on work time.  For the record, I was at lunch.  :)  Anyway, a few passive agressive gestures at his departing back, and I angrily grabbed one of the subjects and chomped down on it.  This triggered the thought of how our civilized psyche copes with stresses that, if we were totally primal, would be expressed in violence.  The photo is essentially a visualization of the act of transferrence, with chocolate as the actors in the play.  Yeah, too many psychology courses in college...  Thanks to everyone that voted, and a special thanks to those that added the photo to their favorites: that''s a real compliment!  This has been my personal best so far!  Whoo hoo!', '2004-07-28 13:53:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(830064, 92663, 12573, '<td valign="top">Looks like a ceiling fan to my eyes, with some monumental camera shake.  LOL!  Congrats.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-28 13:24:06.</i></td>', 'Looks like a ceiling fan to my eyes, with some monumental camera shake.  LOL!  Congrats.', '2004-07-28 14:23:53.000000', '2004-07-28 14:24:06.000000', 0),
(830101, 92663, 7322, '<td valign="top">It''s obviously not about chocolate but I like this photo. It has movement, color, form, and mood. My only problem is it is a bit top heavy. I flipped it horizontally and rotated it and came up with this. <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=94203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/94203.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/94203.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7322/thumb/94203.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>BTW, I didn''t vote on it.</td>', 'It''s obviously not about chocolate but I like this photo. It has movement, color, form, and mood. My only problem is it is a bit top heavy. I flipped it horizontally and rotated it and came up with this.   BTW, I didn''t vote on it.', '2004-07-28 14:45:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(830114, 91844, 20613, '<td valign="top">Oh man...one of my Canadian friends brought me back Smarties a couple times when she visited her family in Canada.  Now I want some :)  As for the photo...I like it, but the flash isn''t working.  Natural ligiht would have probably allowed the photo to place a lot higher.  great subject, though :):)</td>', 'Oh man...one of my Canadian friends brought me back Smarties a couple times when she visited her family in Canada.  Now I want some :)  As for the photo...I like it, but the flash isn''t working.  Natural ligiht would have probably allowed the photo to place a lot higher.  great subject, though :):)', '2004-07-28 14:52:44.000000', NULL, 0),
