(830177, 92287, 14773, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Harryg:</b></div><hr/><i> Thanks for the comments almost everyone as for calling someones work s**t goldberry all i have to say is if you cant give constructive critisism dont bother at all </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL I think most people would agree I never called your work sh*t, feel free to interpret as you will, but my comment was directed at the object itself resembling poo. And it''s CHOCOLATE, chocolate LOGS have a tendency to resemble certain..things.</td>', 'Originally posted by Harryg: Thanks for the comments almost everyone as for calling someones work s**t goldberry all i have to say is if you cant give constructive critisism dont bother at all   LOL I think most people would agree I never called your work sh*t, feel free to interpret as you will, but my comment was directed at the object itself resembling poo. And it''s CHOCOLATE, chocolate LOGS have a tendency to resemble certain..things.', '2004-07-28 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(830200, 92268, 24239, '<td valign="top">I didn''t use oil or heat lamps to get the sheen. I used spray acrylic. The acrylic soaked into the chips rather quickly, so I had to reapply. They did get a little glossier than I would have liked, this is one of my later shots. Unfortunately I couldn''t eat any of the chocolates afterwards.</td>', 'I didn''t use oil or heat lamps to get the sheen. I used spray acrylic. The acrylic soaked into the chips rather quickly, so I had to reapply. They did get a little glossier than I would have liked, this is one of my later shots. Unfortunately I couldn''t eat any of the chocolates afterwards.', '2004-07-28 15:22:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(830314, 92546, 24072, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for their helpful critique of my first DPC entry. I have learned so much already and hope this is just the beginning of many more learning opportunities to come.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for their helpful critique of my first DPC entry. I have learned so much already and hope this is just the beginning of many more learning opportunities to come.', '2004-07-28 16:39:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(830417, 92553, 24669, '<td valign="top">i think this shoot should be a 10 rated one,the yellow lightening from down make us feel the hit atmosphere andine the same time contardicts with the cold white lightening coming from above,this contradiction creates a sweet shoot for the pic,well done bongo</td>', 'i think this shoot should be a 10 rated one,the yellow lightening from down make us feel the hit atmosphere andine the same time contardicts with the cold white lightening coming from above,this contradiction creates a sweet shoot for the pic,well done bongo', '2004-07-28 17:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
