(830519, 92524, 21183, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone.  <br/>Didn''t expect 11th place, so I am pleased about that!  The comments have been really helpful - yet again.  Some wonderful suggestions and ideas have been made for possible improvements to the photo - they all help me to see it in a different way, broadening my perspective and my mind.  Seeing other''s photos and reading the threads also help enormously, but particularly seeing other''s photos.  There''s some really creative photography on the site.  Hoping to pick some ''favourites'' out soon.</td>', 'Thanks everyone.  Didn''t expect 11th place, so I am pleased about that!  The comments have been really helpful - yet again.  Some wonderful suggestions and ideas have been made for possible improvements to the photo - they all help me to see it in a different way, broadening my perspective and my mind.  Seeing other''s photos and reading the threads also help enormously, but particularly seeing other''s photos.  There''s some really creative photography on the site.  Hoping to pick some ''favourites'' out soon.', '2004-07-28 18:23:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(830561, 92450, 21183, '<td valign="top">Well done on the Blue Ribbon.  Will look forward to seeing more of your work in the challenges to come.  This particular photo is fascinating, particularly by the way those splashes out from the centre almost appear like eyelashes.</td>', 'Well done on the Blue Ribbon.  Will look forward to seeing more of your work in the challenges to come.  This particular photo is fascinating, particularly by the way those splashes out from the centre almost appear like eyelashes.', '2004-07-28 18:57:52.000000', NULL, 0),
