(830741, 91356, 6771, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for commenting on my shot.  the questions...<br/>title<br/>Rare Air=about 11,000ft above sea level, hiked 3.5 miles with an elevation gain of about 2,300 ft.<br/>Inspiration(squared)=the view and mountain are insirational, not to mention the M&amp;M''s to inspire my depleted energy sources to continue on.<br/>...ration=candy is a ration (food).<br/> <br/>What appears to be a sleeve is actually my Suunto watchband (the watch with altimeter, barometer, compass, etc., etc., etc.<br/> <br/>Anyone see the Beaver in this pic?  Guess I could have titled it...Feeding the Beaver.  Then no one would get it, unless you see him!??<br/> <br/>And Tundra Cairn in Balance was mine also.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for commenting on my shot.  the questions...titleRare Air=about 11,000ft above sea level, hiked 3.5 miles with an elevation gain of about 2,300 ft.Inspiration(squared)=the view and mountain are insirational, not to mention the M&M''s to inspire my depleted energy sources to continue on....ration=candy is a ration (food). What appears to be a sleeve is actually my Suunto watchband (the watch with altimeter, barometer, compass, etc., etc., etc. Anyone see the Beaver in this pic?  Guess I could have titled it...Feeding the Beaver.  Then no one would get it, unless you see him!?? And Tundra Cairn in Balance was mine also.', '2004-07-28 20:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(830758, 92005, 23478, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed the photo... very creative, put together well, and I thought it would rate higher.</td>', 'I enjoyed the photo... very creative, put together well, and I thought it would rate higher.', '2004-07-28 21:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(831094, 92577, 22659, '<td valign="top">I would have scored your chocolate pic a higher than I did but it looks like you used a metal bowl. (cringing) lol I hate eating anything out of metal. The sound and feel of cutlery scraping up against it give me severe goosebumps. I am almost getting them just thinking about it. lol 30th place is pretty good :) Keep up the great work! I can''t wait to see your album cover.</td>', 'I would have scored your chocolate pic a higher than I did but it looks like you used a metal bowl. (cringing) lol I hate eating anything out of metal. The sound and feel of cutlery scraping up against it give me severe goosebumps. I am almost getting them just thinking about it. lol 30th place is pretty good :) Keep up the great work! I can''t wait to see your album cover.', '2004-07-29 00:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
