(831129, 92642, 22975, '<td valign="top">i thought i commented on this during the challenge, but i didn''t.  i gave you a 10, the only one i handed out in this challenge.  i just think the composition is fabulous.  some people complained about the graininess, but i like it... it makes it appear more like a painting... art... :)  great job.</td>', 'i thought i commented on this during the challenge, but i didn''t.  i gave you a 10, the only one i handed out in this challenge.  i just think the composition is fabulous.  some people complained about the graininess, but i like it... it makes it appear more like a painting... art... :)  great job.', '2004-07-29 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 0),
