(831362, 92504, 22734, '<td valign="top">The object here is using the kisses as wedges much you would a lemon. I did not intend to balance the kisses therefore I hot knifes a wedge into them to lay snug on the glass rim. The silhoettes are hand cut vinyl on plexi. Shot with three strobes. One behind plexi, and two bouced so as to avoid hitting the plexi with the cut-outs. I get the urge for these ideas because I do not take challenges too literal with food and candy. There are enough literal entries to carry the day and then what do I do with the stuff? lol</td>', 'The object here is using the kisses as wedges much you would a lemon. I did not intend to balance the kisses therefore I hot knifes a wedge into them to lay snug on the glass rim. The silhoettes are hand cut vinyl on plexi. Shot with three strobes. One behind plexi, and two bouced so as to avoid hitting the plexi with the cut-outs. I get the urge for these ideas because I do not take challenges too literal with food and candy. There are enough literal entries to carry the day and then what do I do with the stuff? lol', '2004-07-29 01:59:14.000000', NULL, 0),
