(831797, 92561, 16493, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Gurilla:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe it dosen''t matter to you but adding the suffering child did not make the photo more appealing to me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL!<br/>This theme is good, a lot of things came to mind when I was looking at this photo, made me think. I gave it 6 - probably should have voted it 7 but it laks a bit on the technical side. Well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-29 09:08:07.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Gurilla: Maybe it dosen''t matter to you but adding the suffering child did not make the photo more appealing to me.   LOL!This theme is good, a lot of things came to mind when I was looking at this photo, made me think. I gave it 6 - probably should have voted it 7 but it laks a bit on the technical side. Well done.', '2004-07-29 10:07:10.000000', '2004-07-29 10:08:07.000000', 0),
