(833786, 92405, 669, '<td valign="top">I was considering a macro shot too.  I really like this, nice crispness on the chocolate powder.  Might have chosen a deeper DOF personally.  Nice lighting and colour too.</td>', 'I was considering a macro shot too.  I really like this, nice crispness on the chocolate powder.  Might have chosen a deeper DOF personally.  Nice lighting and colour too.', '2004-07-30 18:59:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(833954, 92450, 3575, '<td valign="top">Eu estou usando o tradutor da língua de Google assim que este pôde soar engraçado.  Eu amo o tiro, ele sou a mais melhor foto que do respingo da gota eu penso que eu vi.  É apenas perfeita.  Felicitações!  Eu estou olhando para a frente a ver mais trabalho de você.</td>', 'Eu estou usando o tradutor da língua de Google assim que este pôde soar engraçado.  Eu amo o tiro, ele sou a mais melhor foto que do respingo da gota eu penso que eu vi.  É apenas perfeita.  Felicitações!  Eu estou olhando para a frente a ver mais trabalho de você.', '2004-07-30 21:26:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(834070, 92619, 14614, '<td valign="top">Hi Melissa:<br/> <br/>Greeting from the Critique Club -- hello to a fellow member -- the pressure''s on me to offer as good a critique as you do :)<br/> <br/>It seems by the few comments that you''ve fallen into the "average score" category here.  You meet the challenge and there is a good technical quality to your shot.   <br/> <br/>What strikes me first about your shot is that each element has a different color and there is no unifying element or main element to pull the composition together - it''s as if each (the chocolate, strawberry, background, wings, bug body, and leaves) all take the same weight in the shot and in a way compete for my attention.  <br/> <br/>Compositionally, you have only one two items but they are bundled so tightly together that the composition doesn''t allow me to explore the frame.<br/> <br/>If you have any questions or comments, please pm me.  I''ve enjoyed looking at your photographs and wish you lots of good shooting!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Theresa</td>', 'Hi Melissa: Greeting from the Critique Club -- hello to a fellow member -- the pressure''s on me to offer as good a critique as you do :) It seems by the few comments that you''ve fallen into the "average score" category here.  You meet the challenge and there is a good technical quality to your shot.    What strikes me first about your shot is that each element has a different color and there is no unifying element or main element to pull the composition together - it''s as if each (the chocolate, strawberry, background, wings, bug body, and leaves) all take the same weight in the shot and in a way compete for my attention.   Compositionally, you have only one two items but they are bundled so tightly together that the composition doesn''t allow me to explore the frame. If you have any questions or comments, please pm me.  I''ve enjoyed looking at your photographs and wish you lots of good shooting! Regards,Theresa', '2004-07-30 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(834079, 92450, 16256, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by joanns:</b></div><hr/><i> Eu estou usando o tradutor da língua de Google assim que este pôde soar engraçado.  Eu amo o tiro, ele sou a mais melhor foto que do respingo da gota eu penso que eu vi.  É apenas perfeita.  Felicitações!  Eu estou olhando para a frente a ver mais trabalho de você. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Perfeitamente compreensível. Agradeço a gentileza e carinho das suas palavras. (Perfectly comprehensible. I thank the kindness and affection of their words).</td>', 'Originally posted by joanns: Eu estou usando o tradutor da língua de Google assim que este pôde soar engraçado.  Eu amo o tiro, ele sou a mais melhor foto que do respingo da gota eu penso que eu vi.  É apenas perfeita.  Felicitações!  Eu estou olhando para a frente a ver mais trabalho de você.   Perfeitamente compreensível. Agradeço a gentileza e carinho das suas palavras. (Perfectly comprehensible. I thank the kindness and affection of their words).', '2004-07-30 23:27:50.000000', NULL, 0),
