(840715, 91633, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hello Ásmundur from the Critique Club <br/> <br/>Congratulations on your fabulous image. I am supposed to critique your image and with an image like yours it is a very hard job for me to find any faults. The only one I can possibly think of is there are not enough chocolates. Ha ha <br/>Stunning image with lovely reds. Chocolate is a lovely colour also<br/>Excellent idea and composition<br/>Great focus and detail <br/>Simple yet elegant<br/>There were a lot of excellent images in this challenge and yet there can be only 3 ribbons in my opinion you are up there with the winners!<br/>I looked at some of your other images in your profile and you have great colour and focus and have definate talent IMHO<br/> Enjoy your photography and good luck in future Challenges <br/>I hope my comments are of help. Feel free to P M me if you have any questions.<br/>Regards<br/> Sally</td>', 'Hello Ásmundur from the Critique Club  Congratulations on your fabulous image. I am supposed to critique your image and with an image like yours it is a very hard job for me to find any faults. The only one I can possibly think of is there are not enough chocolates. Ha ha Stunning image with lovely reds. Chocolate is a lovely colour alsoExcellent idea and compositionGreat focus and detail Simple yet elegantThere were a lot of excellent images in this challenge and yet there can be only 3 ribbons in my opinion you are up there with the winners!I looked at some of your other images in your profile and you have great colour and focus and have definate talent IMHO Enjoy your photography and good luck in future Challenges I hope my comments are of help. Feel free to P M me if you have any questions.Regards Sally', '2004-08-04 00:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
